  ('ioe-ep1', 19, 'CalibrationLunchbox', 'av-cyberlunchbox', 'Member', 87, true, 'Yo just got home and watched the raw stream, my Japanese is trash so I don''t know exactly what was said in the rooftop scene but you guys are scaring me with these reactions lol. Is the baby thing gonna be a stuck-in-the-game thing or something else entirely?

