  ('ioe-ep1', 30, 'PlanetationBro', 'av-bluesoda', 'Senior Member', 1907, true, '[quote=SakugaThreadZero — #12 (page 1)]Confirmed cast on the JP listing btw: Sora Gauthier — Mariya Ise, Grayson Rothenberg — Nobuhiko Okamoto, Abigail June — Kana Hanazawa, Ben Smythe — Kaito Ishikawa...[/quote]

