  ('ioe-ep1', 37, 'RetroBluRay_AMV', 'av-retrobluray', 'Forum Regular', 1424, true, 'Quick FYI to #36 and anyone else asking: per AniWire''s listing it''s an original anime, no LN or manga preceding it. AniBlex production with [b]Burst[/b] on the animation — brand new studio, this is their debut show, but the staff list is basically the Flow Pictures cinematic crew that did Sinful Apex so it tracks. BD release announced for late January 2014, single volume per disc, 4 episodes per disc.

