idk man. I''m just trying to enjoy a fun show. you guys are eating glass already.', '2013-10-05T23:48:00Z', 'PDT', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 47, 'GoldenSloth_Animu', 'av-hyperneko', 'Newbie', 3, true, 'am I the only one who thinks this premiere was a MESS? like genuinely. don''t get me wrong I had a good time. but they jammed:

[list]
[*]cold open mystery
[*]a school day with 6 different cliques
[*]a hallway brawl with MMO UI overlays
[*]essay punishment scene
[*]rooftop monologue
[*]after-school vending machine
[*]train station chat
[*]VR boot up
[*]4 unique signature weapons explained
[*]division choice debate
[*]whole boss fight
[*]scoreboard scene with 2 new characters
[*]a STORM reveal
[/list]

...into 22 minutes. that''s not pacing that''s a fire sale. I''ll give it ep 2 to figure out what it actually is but right now it just feels like the writers didn''t want to cut anything.', '2013-10-05T23:54:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 48, 'NovaFanPixel', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Database Contributor', 6214, true, '[quote=GoldenSloth_Animu;47]that''s not pacing that''s a fire sale.[/quote]

respectfully I disagree but I see your point. the show is doing a thing where the volume IS the texture. it''s not telling you "remember every detail of this hallway fight". it''s saying "this kid lives in a noisy crowded panopticon school where chaos is the baseline." everything is set dressing for "Sora doesn''t fit here, that''s the point."

like, the essay punishment scene isn''t important to the plot. it''s important because it makes Sora ASK to go to the rooftop. and then the rooftop monologue is what matters.

it''s not a fire sale, it''s overstuffed BY DESIGN. you''re supposed to feel slightly overwhelmed.

that said, totally fair to bounce off it. ep 2 will tell us if the show can actually breathe when it needs to.', '2013-10-06T00:06:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 49, 'NodeCoreOmega', 'av-calsparrow', 'Senior Member', 2890, false, 'I''m gonna be the unfun guy in this thread:

