  ('ioe-ep1', 108, 'CalibrationSparrow88', 'av-calsparrow', 'Forum Regular', 1022, false, '[b]TEAM ABIGAIL[/b] is not just a best-girl joke it''s the cleanest proof that Eden is not doing male-dominant action w/ female support Grayson creates space, Sora breaks the pattern, but Abigail makes the decisive call & ends the encounter the final image of the YAMAGA fight is not a boy posing over a kill it''s Abigail rolling out of a one-cut grapple finisher, clutching her necklace, & realizing she just ended it', '2013-10-06T15:58:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 109, 'PlanetationBro', 'av-bluesoda', 'Senior Member', 1914, true, 'rewatched episode 1 with friends tonight. the pacing in this premiere is so well done:

