  ('ioe-ep1', 112, 'BadEnding_Fan', 'av-nekotoast', 'Member', 357, false, 'the part that''s killing me is that burst gave the same animation respect to the women in the cast as the men frame-for-frame minute-for-minute grayson''s flaming-blade choreography on yamaga is brilliant and it gets matched by abigail''s grapple finisher w/ equal key-animator labor that''s parity at the production level, and it doesn''t happen by accident somebody at burst on the storyboard layer said "women don''t get less detail than the men in this show" and takuya''s manga gets the adaptation it deserves', '2013-10-06T17:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
