  ('ioe-ep1', 130, 'xXBakaSenseiXx', 'av-guestcone', 'Newbie', 257, true, 'what Eden is doing with the women is not unprecedented but it IS rare. the closest comp I can think of is shows where the writer treated every female character with the same seriousness as the male ones. usually that comes from manga authors who actually like women as ppl. [b]Natsuki Takuya[/b] is in that lineage. Burst preserved it. let''s keep saying it loud enough that the suits notice.', '2013-10-06T20:48:00Z', 'JST', '2013-10-06T22:13:00Z', 'added link', false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 131, 'FillerEpisodeFan', 'av-nekotoast', 'Member', 276, false, 'A few thoughts on Episode 1 after my second watch:

- The weapon designs r amazing. Grayson using twin Crucible greatswords to herd YAMAGA into Sora''s attack path was brilliant squad tactics.
- Ben is pure comedic relief, disabling his safety governors immediately XD
- Studio Burst''s animation and sound design in the lobby scene was so atmospheric.

Bring on Episode 2 next Sunday!', '2013-10-06T20:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 132, 'MillenniumAnimeFan2001', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 54, false, 'Rewatched ep 1 w/ friends tonight. The pacing in this premiere is so well done:

