  ('ioe-ep1', 164, 'CalibrationSparrow88', 'av-calsparrow', 'Forum Regular', 1027, false, 'the Grayson sequence is doing the smartest thing in the fight: he''s not fighting YAMAGA, he''s CONTROLLING the space around him so Sora can. that''s a support char carrying himself like a lead. the way the dual blades arc independently of each other — one circling, one carving — is the kind of choreography u only get when the Action Director (Kagura per the BD listing) has done squad-tactics shows before... smh', '2013-10-07T01:50:00Z', 'CET', null, null, false, 'archived'),
