  ('ioe-ep1', 181, 'PlanetationLag', 'av-guestsignal', 'Member', 421, true, 'the MetaCode charge before Sora''s burst step is sakuga plain and simple you get the plate-shift transformation, the spiraling energy ramp up the arm, the eye flick when his focus locks on YAMAGA''s blind spot, and THEN the burst step launches and the camera doesn''t even try to follow it — it just smears that''s an animator going "I want this one" and the studio saying yes', '2013-10-07T03:56:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
