  ('ioe-ep1', 186, 'Kappa_Zero_Yokai', 'av-kappazero', 'Member', 351, true, 'Burst''s commitment to drawing women in MOTION instead of in poses is the under-discussed flex of this episode. Echo parkours. Abigail rolls badly after the finisher. Likko stomps. Miyuki barely shifts her weight (motion in stillness). Nova carries a tray. Lisa points at things. Sarah lifts her phone. every female character has a CHARACTER VERB in ep 1, and the verb is what defines them on screen. that''s animation as character writing. that''s Takuya''s manga DNA preserved in adaptation. lmao', '2013-10-07T04:32:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
