  ('ioe-ep1', 203, 'NodeCorePilot', 'av-mecharonin', 'Senior Member', 2213, true, 'the animation in the yamaga fight was insane for a premiere studio burst''s debut is showing off so hard! the way sora uses the metacode arm-charge to burst-step thru yamaga''s blind spot was peak hype lol', '2013-10-07T06:24:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 204, 'NekoToast92', 'av-nekotoast', 'Forum Regular', 900, true, 'METACODE CHARGE SAKUGA POST the moment everyone needs to rewatch frame by frame: Sora''s arm BREAKS into MetaCode mode, plates flicker, the energy charge winds up the forearm in spirals, then the whole thing FIRES into the burst step that is hand-animated, that is single-animator-shows-off frames, and the smear-frame on the launch alone is going on screenshot threads for the rest of the year fr', '2013-10-07T06:31:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 205, 'ChibiComet_92', 'av-chibicomet', 'Forum Regular', 1111, true, 'Burst animated [b]Abigail walking through the school riot with her hands in her hoodie pockets[/b]. I cannot stress this enough. the chaos breaks AROUND her body. she doesn''t react. she doesn''t grab a weapon. she just MOVES through it like the storm doesn''t apply to her. that staging choice taught us before the YAMAGA fight that Abigail is the un-rattle-able one. & then the storyboard followed through by giving her the K.O. shot. setup → payoff at the char-design level. that''s the Takuya pipeline doing its job.', '2013-10-07T06:38:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 206, 'GamletCoffee', 'av-rawrxd', 'Newbie', 760, true, 'Just finished Episode 1! I thought this was gonna be a basic VR school anime, but the ending went full nightmare mode XD When YAMAGA284 appeared and the READ LEVEL started dropping, the atmosphere turned so intense. Fall season is saved!

