  ('ioe-ep1', 217, 'StormWallTheory', 'av-stormwalltheory', 'Senior Member', 3035, true, 'Likko Valenne is the secretary of Hammond Council 1 and she''s voiced by [b]Ayane Sakura[/b] just say that out loud Ayane Sakura on Council 1 w/ Hayami, Satou, Shimono, and Kamiya they put FIVE elite VAs in one squad there is no way this is an accident somebody at Burst made this casting call on purpose and we are going to feel it in episode 4 or whenever the Council finally gets a real arc', '2013-10-07T07:52:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 218, 'HyperNekoMimi', 'av-hyperneko', 'Forum Regular', 501, true, 'mariya ise as sora is such a good casting choice! sora sounds genuinely 12 without being annoying, and his energy during the fight scene felt so scrappy and real. 10/10 voice work... frfr', '2013-10-07T07:58:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 219, 'FreshOctober2013', 'av-calsparrow', 'Senior Member', 365, true, 'Rewatched Episode 1 with friends tonight. The pacing in this premiere is so well done:

