  ('ioe-ep1', 223, 'BostonBaka_Gaijin', 'av-bostonbean', 'Member', 318, true, 'sora''s ''i hate later'' rooftop line hit me right in the feels ;_;', '2013-10-07T08:29:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 224, 'AbigailFanAlready', 'av-abigailfan', 'Member', 514, true, 'we need a frame-by-frame appreciation thread for Abigail''s grapple cut alone. the hair physics that settle for ONE beat at the apex of her swing before falling back down. the flame guns firing at near-contact range without the muzzle flash washing her face out. the way the camera holds on her face during the explosion instead of cutting to YAMAGA''s body. somebody at Burst said "this is HER kill cam, the camera looks at HER." Takuya philosophy translated to motion.', '2013-10-07T08:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 225, 'MetaCodeArmFan', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Newbie', 267, true, 'the way burst handles the five female leads together vs separately is also smart in the lobby they read as a unit (council 1, full squad framing) in the field they read as individuals (echo parkour, likko taunting, miyuki commanding) neither mode reduces them they can be a coordinated team or distinct individuals depending on what the scene needs that''s range that''s structure that''s the opposite of "interchangeable side girls" lol', '2013-10-07T08:41:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 226, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2137, true, 'can we talk about how this means saori hayami is the lead of an ensemble where her four squadmates are rina satou, hiro shimono, hiroshi kamiya, and ayane sakura. hayami has to [i]carry[/i] a squad of those four. that''s not casting, that''s a casting [b]statement[/b]. [b]am i hearing something!?!?!?![/b]', '2013-10-07T08:47:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 227, 'FreshOctober2013', 'av-calsparrow', 'Member', 62, true, 'miyku''s speech at teh end... Saori Hayami''s voice gave me chills o_O', '2013-10-07T08:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 228, 'NovaFanPixel', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Database Contributor', 6224, false, 'the thing about yamaga being nightmare fuel is that he''s not even doing horror movie poses. he''s doing fight poses. he just happens to look wrong while doing them. that''s a much harder design problem and burst nailed it on a debut. evil.', '2013-10-07T08:59:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
