  ('ioe-ep1', 243, 'ToonblockKid', 'av-toonblock', 'Forum Regular', 655, true, 'Mariya Ise as Sora is such a good casting choice! Sora sounds genuinely 12 w/o being annoying, & his energy during the fight scene felt so scrappy & real 10/10 voice work smh', '2013-10-07T10:25:00Z', 'EDT', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 244, 'sleepySenpai_DesuKa', 'av-sleepysenpai', 'Member', 400, true, 'Holy crap, the YAMAGA fight animation was incredible! Studio Burst went all out XD', '2013-10-07T10:31:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 245, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2464, false, 'the line nobody is talking about enough: Nova''s "[b]that is why we have to take a stand. even if we''re all morally wrong.[/b]" that is the thesis of the entire series being telegraphed in ep one and it comes from a WOMAN''S MOUTH. it''s not from Sora. it''s not from Grayson. it''s not from Gamlet. it''s from Nova. that is the LOUDEST writing-room signal u can possibly send about who''s carrying this show''s moral spine.', '2013-10-07T10:37:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 246, 'IsekaiSurvivorKun', 'av-nodeomega', 'Newbie', 785, true, 'Abigail is best girl this season hands down Her flame guns is so cool <3', '2013-10-07T10:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 247, 'OkamotoAcolyte', 'av-okamoto', 'Forum Regular', 1126, false, 'the parallel between Miyuki''s thesis speech and Nova''s "we have to take a stand" line is INTENTIONAL. they''re delivered in different rooms by different characters at different moments but they are SAYING THE SAME THING in different registers. Miyuki: poetic, defiant, philosophical. Nova: flat, exhausted, professional. same moral spine, two voices. Eden just gave the show''s central message to two women back to back. and people are still calling them "side cast." READ THE ep.', '2013-10-07T10:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 248, 'CalibrationSparrow88', 'av-calsparrow', 'Forum Regular', 1034, true, 'sora''s ''i hate later'' rooftop line hit me right in the feels ;_; tbh', '2013-10-07T10:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
