  ('ioe-ep1', 258, 'BurstAnimKid', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Member', 264, true, '''beginner trial'' my entire ass. yamaga is faceless body horror in a fight that''s supposed to introduce mechanics. nobody designs a tutorial boss like that unless they want you scared of what''s coming next. burst really said ''welcome to the show, here''s a permanent face you''ll see in your dreams.'' smh', '2013-10-07T11:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 259, 'ChibiComet_92', 'av-chibicomet', 'Forum Regular', 1116, true, 'rewatched epside 1 w/ friends tonight. the pacing in this premiere is so well done:

1. the cold open immediately sets up a creepy mystery w/ the blue egg under the world tree.
2. the school and lobby scenes introduce the main crew (sora, grayson, abigail, ben) naturally without long boring info-dumps.
3. the yamaga284 fight delivers top-tier action sakuga, and miyuki''s speech at the end sets up the stakes for the whole show.

easily one of the best premiere eps of 2013! ngl', '2013-10-07T11:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
