  ('ioe-ep1', 267, 'TruckKun_Driver', 'av-guestcone', 'Newbie', 350, false, 'YAMAGA284 is genuinely scary. for a ''tutorial boss'' he is way too unsettling. the BLANK face. the way he doesn''t make NOISE when he moves, just appears. the READ LEVEL ticking down isn''t just power-scaling, it''s the show telling u he''s LEARNING u in real time. that is not how a normal game boss works. that''s a horror enemy.', '2013-10-07T12:37:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 268, 'BurstAnimKid', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Member', 265, false, 'The animation in the YAMAGA fight was insane for a premiere. Studio Burst''s debut is showing off so hard! The way Sora uses the MetaCode arm-charge to burst-step through YAMAGA''s blind spot was peak hype.

