  ('ioe-ep1', 269, 'HirotoHiro53', 'av-sorawatcher', 'Newbie', 36, false, 'okay one more abigail sakuga post. the smear-frame on the swing-up. the way her hair physics actually settle for one beat at the apex of the swing before falling back down. the flame guns firing at near-contact range w/o losing readability. a single cut doing the work of 5 cuts. peak.', '2013-10-07T12:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
