  ('ioe-ep1', 271, 'xXSoraGauthier_KunXx', 'av-starcircuit', 'Anime Addict', 1367, true, 'My current theory for the show: the storm in Planetation isn''t jus an in-game weather hazard, it''s connected to the blue egg from the cold open The World Tree pulse in the opening scene was def a warning sign o_O fr lol', '2013-10-07T12:58:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 272, 'ProtagPlotArmor', 'av-day01', 'Forum Regular', 684, false, '"Restrictions behind history are merely an excuse to refuse living!" — miyku, in a TUTORIAL LOBBY, in a kid''s VR game, in episode 1 who let them write that who let her DELIVER it that''s a season finale line & it''s right there in the premiere fr', '2013-10-07T13:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 273, 'StormWallTheory', 'av-stormwalltheory', 'Senior Member', 3040, true, 'Just finished Episode 1! I thought this was gonna be a basic VR school anime, but the ending went full nightmare mode XD When YAMAGA284 appeared and the READ LEVEL started dropping, the atmosphere turned so intense Fall season is saved!', '2013-10-07T13:08:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 274, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2141, true, 'the silent-girl, loud-girl pairing in this show is wild. Nova (quiet, professional, exhausted, knows everything) & Likko (loud, impatient, comedic, also competent). both functional. both leads of their own scenes. neither one props up a male char. they have FULL personalities that exist independent of the male cast. that''s TWO women in a 22-minute premiere who passed the no-prop-for-a-boy test. Eden is built different.', '2013-10-07T13:13:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
