  ('ioe-ep1', 287, 'CipherCaramel_Cyberpunk', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Member', 276, true, 'trying to articulate why Abigail''s grapple finisher hits harder than any of the boys'' moments in ep 1: the boys'' moments r [i]established mechanics paying off[/i] (Crucible Blades, MetaCode awakening). Abigail''s moment is [i]improvisation under pressure[/i]. she sees the opening. she makes the call. she commits. she lands it. she rolls badly because realism. she clutches her necklace. that''s a full character beat, not a power-up reveal. that''s why it lands...', '2013-10-07T14:20:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
