  ('ioe-ep1', 296, 'MillenniumAnimeFan2001', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 68, false, 'okay can we talk about [b]sarah[/b] specifically? she''s on screen for maybe 40 seconds total in ep 1. she is doing crisis management on her phone during the riot. we don''t know who she''s calling. we don''t know what her abilities are yet. but the staging in that scene shows her problem-solving while two boys around her are venting and yelling. sarah is going to be a leader and we just got the seed of it.', '2013-10-07T15:06:00Z', 'JST', '2013-10-07T15:26:00Z', 'typo', false, 'archived'),
