  ('ioe-ep1', 299, 'ToonblockKid', 'av-toonblock', 'Forum Regular', 660, false, 'okay so when Sora''s MetaCode charges before the burst step, watch the BACKGROUND. the floor textures distort in a half-circle around him. that''s a custom FX layer. for one move. in EP 1. Burst really hand-rolled bespoke FX for a single animation beat. that''s a flex move and I respect it...', '2013-10-07T15:21:00Z', 'JST', '2013-10-07T15:24:00Z', 'typo on ''Crucible''', false, 'archived'),
