  ('ioe-ep1', 331, 'PlanetationBro', 'av-bluesoda', 'Senior Member', 1933, true, 'I want to call out one more thing because it''s bugging me: the show does not separate "action women" from "thinking women" Abigail fights AND thinks Miyuki commands AND philosophizes Nova analyzes AND emotes Echo moves AND coordinates Likko jokes AND shoots Lisa reads AND anchors Sarah plans AND acts they r all multi-axis chars in one ep that''s the OPPOSITE of "male dominate, female support" that''s "every woman in this cast has at least two functioning gears" Takuya wrote them that way Burst drew them that way respect it', '2013-10-07T17:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
