  ('ioe-ep1', 337, 'Eden_Day01', 'av-day01', 'Member', 326, false, 'The animation in the YAMAGA fight was insane for a premiere. Studio Burst''s debut is showing off so hard! The way Sora uses the MetaCode arm-charge to burst-step through YAMAGA''s blind spot was peak hype... fr', '2013-10-07T18:21:00Z', 'JST', '2013-10-07T19:28:00Z', 'softened the take after rewatch', false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 338, 'BurstAnimKid', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Member', 270, true, 'the moment YAMAGA tilts his head a quarter inch when Sora burst-steps through his blind spot & the READ LEVEL drops to 30%? I stood up. that head tilt is doing more characterization than entire seasons of villains in other shows. nightmare fuel. tbh', '2013-10-07T18:26:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 339, 'PlanetationBro', 'av-bluesoda', 'Senior Member', 1933, true, 'abigail is best girl this season hands down. her flame guns is so cool <3', '2013-10-07T18:30:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 340, 'BadEnding_Fan', 'av-nekotoast', 'Senior Member', 8, true, 'the staging tell I keep coming back to: [b]Miyuki is staged on a higher platform than Sora[/b] in the lobby exposition. literally elevated. Burst could have put them on the same level. they chose to elevate her. the show is using vertical staging to tell u who u should be reading as the authority figure in this scene. that''s not subtle and it''s not a coincidence. she is composed UP. respect the framing.', '2013-10-07T18:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
