  ('ioe-ep1', 355, 'Kappa_Zero_Yokai', 'av-kappazero', 'Member', 365, false, 'teh miyku speech animtion is doing teh opposite of what 99% of 2013 shows would do. no push-in, no low-up shot, no hype-cuts. jus a wide hold with her hair animated separately against teh data tower wind and a 2-3 pixel-per-second downward camera drift over 8 seconds. that''s a hand-drawn camera move done with care. that''s a key animator saying "stillness is teh character." exactly how [b]natsuki takuya[/b] draws her in teh manga.', '2013-10-07T19:43:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
