  ('ioe-ep1', 375, 'HyperNekoMimi', 'av-hyperneko', 'Forum Regular', 514, true, 'I love that the show didn''t give the girls matching outfits or hair colors to make them "the squad." each woman is visually distinct. different hair. different builds. different fashion. different weapons. different fight styles. different voice ranges. they don''t blur into a "girl team" silhouette. they read as ppl first and squad members second. that''s char design respecting personhood. [b]Takuya philosophy[/b] at the visual development stage.', '2013-10-07T21:12:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 376, 'RetroBluRay_AMV', 'av-retrobluray', 'Forum Regular', 1455, true, 'bd release reminder: late january 2014, single volume per disc, 4 eps per disc. screenshots will be glorious.', '2013-10-07T21:16:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 377, 'OldManManga_v2', 'av-robomango', 'Newbie', 227, true, 'the Abigail mid-air grapple finisher is sakuga in its purest form one cut zero cheat-cuts arms, weapon, grapple, environment, YAMAGA''s body all moving in correct relative space the entire time that''s not an action scene, that''s a dance number, and only ONE animator gets to put their name on it tbh', '2013-10-07T21:20:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
