  ('ioe-ep1', 457, 'Senpai_Notes', 'av-calsparrow', 'Newbie', 142, true, 'nova''s animation is sneaky-incredible she walks in carrying coffee that''s the setup and burst animated her shoulders dropping by like 1-2 pixels when she looks at the player counter ticking down they drew exhaustion into her posture, not her dialogue then yui ishikawa delivers "it''s over" flat and burst doesn''t even cut to a reaction they trust the audience that''s takuya''s whole approach to writing women: emotional weight in the body, not in the lines', '2013-10-08T02:49:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
