  ('ioe-ep1', 460, 'RetroBluRay_AMV', 'av-retrobluray', 'Forum Regular', 1454, false, 'the Abigail mid-air grapple finisher is sakuga in its purest form. one cut. zero cheat-cuts. arms, weapon, grapple, environment, YAMAGA''s body all moving in correct relative space the entire time. that''s not an action scene, that''s a dance number, & only ONE animator gets to put their name on it.', '2013-10-08T03:01:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
