  ('ioe-ep1', 492, 'HammondCouncilStan', 'av-toonblock', 'Senior Member', 6, true, 'Mariya Ise as Sora is such a good casting choice! Sora sounds genuinely 12 without being annoying, and his energy during the fight scene felt so scrappy and real 10/10 voice work', '2013-10-08T05:04:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 493, 'OkamotoAcolyte', 'av-okamoto', 'Forum Regular', 1146, false, 'what Eden is doing with the women is not unprecedented but it IS rare the closest comp I can think of is shows where the writer treated every female character with the same seriousness as the male ones usually that comes from manga authors who actually like women as ppl [b]Natsuki Takuya[/b] is in that lineage Burst preserved it let''s keep saying it loud enough that the suits notice', '2013-10-08T05:07:00Z', 'JST', '2013-10-08T06:23:00Z', 'trimmed wall of text', false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 494, 'MillenniumAnimeFan2001', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 84, false, 'sora''s ''i hate later'' rooftop line hit me right in the feels ;_;', '2013-10-08T05:11:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 495, 'RetroBluRay_AMV', 'av-retrobluray', 'Forum Regular', 1456, false, 'grayson''s choreography on yamaga is the most efficient action work in the ep. zero wasted motion. every blade pass changes yamaga''s footing. he doesn''t even land the kill, he steps back & lets sora take it. that''s a char beat & a fight beat at the same time. peak.', '2013-10-08T05:14:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 496, 'sleepySenpai_DesuKa', 'av-sleepysenpai', 'Member', 421, false, 'the silent-girl, loud-girl pairing in this show is wild. Nova (quiet, professional, exhausted, knows everything) & Likko (loud, impatient, comedic, also competent). both functional. both leads of their own scenes. neither one props up a male character. they have FULL personalities that exist independent of the male cast. that''s TWO women in a 22-minute premiere who passed the no-prop-for-a-boy test. Eden is built different.', '2013-10-08T05:18:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
