  ('ioe-ep1', 502, 'Kappa_Zero_Yokai', 'av-kappazero', 'Member', 377, true, '[b]Rina Satou as Echo Desmond[/b] is going to be teh criminally-underrated VA performance of teh season. her line count in ep 1 is small but every single delivery is loaded: teh "Confirmed. Void Rift." teh small grin in teh lobby. teh off-camera "Lis-ten up." Rina is reading Echo as a confident athlete, not a love interest, not a sidekick, not a tsundere. just a confident pro. that''s REFRESHING and that''s deliberate.', '2013-10-08T05:41:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
