  ('ioe-ep1', 504, 'DrowsyGhostVHS', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Member', 454, false, 'YAMAGA284 is genuinely scary for a ''tutorial boss'' he is way too unsettling the BLANK face the way he doesn''t make NOISE when he moves, just appears the READ LEVEL ticking down isn''t just power-scaling, it''s the show telling u he''s LEARNING u in real time that is not how a normal game boss works that''s a horror enemy tbh', '2013-10-08T05:49:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
