  ('ioe-ep1', 539, 'SakugaThreadZero', 'av-zeroframe', 'Database Contributor', 5927, true, 'okay forum, please add to this list things Burst animated about the girls in ep 1 that they did NOT have to animate:
- Abigail''s necklace clutch mid-fall
- Nova''s 1-pixel shoulder drop at the player counter
- Likko''s 5 NPCs copying her emote rhythm individually
- Miyuki''s micro-frown softening for ONE frame at the end of her speech
- Echo''s body angled into the rail when she confirms Void Rift
- the custom gold-orange tone on Abigail''s flame guns blades
that''s six extra-effort choices for the women in the cast SIX in ONE ep on a DEBUT studio [b]Natsuki Takuya''s manga is in good hands.[/b]', '2013-10-08T07:57:00Z', 'JST', '2013-10-08T08:49:00Z', 'softened the take after rewatch', false, 'archived'),
