  ('ioe-ep1', 571, '3EpisodeRule', 'av-3eprule', 'Senior Member', 1556, true, 'look I keep coming back to the structure of Miyuki''s speech: it goes [i]fear[/i] → [i]walls[/i] → [i]restrictions[/i] → [i]truth[/i] → [i]choice[/i] → [i]refusal[/i]. that''s not a speech, that''s a thesis statement for the WHOLE SHOW. ep 1 is dropping the show''s central theme inside a 25-second monologue & trusting you to remember it. lmao', '2013-10-08T09:51:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
