  ('ioe-ep1', 575, 'TokuFanMango', 'av-robomango', 'Forum Regular', 950, false, 'miyuki kagemitsu has only been on screen for 4 minutes and she already gave the most intimidating speech of the season. ''restrictions behind history r merely an excuse to refuse living!'' saori hayami delivered that line with pure authority <3 ngl', '2013-10-08T10:04:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 576, 'GoldenSloth_Animu', 'av-goldensloth', 'Newbie', 44, true, 'the Sora vs YAMAGA fight is going on the ep 1 highlight reel of the year. period. the entire fight is built to make u trust him as a protag — & it works because Burst shows u his decisions in real time. he''s not ''just strong.'' he''s THINKING. u can see him thinking. peak. fr lol', '2013-10-08T10:07:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
