  ('ioe-ep1', 589, 'PlanetationKid', 'av-planetkid', 'Newbie', 74, false, 'Sora''s MetaCode transformation + charge + burst step is a 30-frame sequence & I have rewatched it like 50 times. the way the plates on the forearm shift INWARD before the energy spirals OUTWARD is the kind of mechanical detail you only get when the character designer (Haraguchi) & the FX AD (Morozumi) actually talk to each other. lol', '2013-10-08T10:52:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
