  ('ioe-ep1', 593, 'Sora_Gauthier_Stan', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Newbie', 655, true, 'the staging tell I keep coming back to: [b]Miyuki is staged on a higher platform than Sora[/b] in the lobby exposition. literally elevated. Burst could have put them on the same level. they chose to elevate her. the show is using vertical staging to tell u who u should be reading as the authority figure in this scene. that''s not subtle & it''s not a coincidence. she is composed UP. respect the framing.', '2013-10-08T11:07:00Z', 'JST', '2013-10-08T12:03:00Z', 'trimmed wall of text', false, 'archived'),
