  ('ioe-ep1', 595, 'RawStreamRider', 'av-calsparrow', 'Newbie', 98, true, 'the moment YAMAGA tilts his head a quarter inch when Sora burst-steps thru his blind spot and the READ LEVEL drops to 30%? I stood up. that head tilt is doing more characterization than entire seasons of villains in other shows. nightmare fuel.', '2013-10-08T11:14:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 596, 'TS_HunterKun', 'av-vermilionowl', 'Member', 313, true, 'likko valenne''s lobby cameo is four seconds long and burst gave it a full key-frame pass with five separately-animated npcs matching her emote rhythm instead of loop-recycling the crowd that''s a hand-drawn crowd reaction for a 4-second comedic beat that''s the studio going "likko''s chaos energy is part of her character, we''re not going to deflate it for a budget shortcut" exactly how takuya draws her in the manga ayane sakura''s energy got into the lines', '2013-10-08T11:17:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 597, 'MillenniumAnimeFan2001', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 93, true, 'the lineup is officially insane. read it again: saori hayami + rina satou + hiro shimono + hiroshi kamiya + ayane sakura. all five in [b]one school council squad[/b] in [b]ep 1[/b] of a [b]debut studio[/b]. [b]am i hearing something!?!?!?![/b] someone tell me this isn''t a fever dream. that''s a cast you''d see headlining a major mid-season blockbuster, not a debut studio''s premiere.', '2013-10-08T11:20:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 598, 'NekoToast92', 'av-nekotoast', 'Forum Regular', 933, true, 'Abigail aiming her dual flame gunss w/ that totally unbothered expression made her my favorite char immediately She''s the only sane person in Sora''s squad lol Can''t wait to see her fight more in Ep 2! frfr', '2013-10-08T11:23:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
