  ('ioe-ep1', 662, 'Eden_Day01', 'av-day01', 'Member', 353, true, 'the part that''s killing me is that burst gave the same animation respect to the women in the cast as the men frame-for-frame minute-for-minute grayson''s flaming-blade choreography on yamaga is brilliant & it gets matched by abigail''s grapple finisher with equal key-animator labor that''s parity at the production level, & it doesn''t happen by accident somebody at burst on the storyboard layer said "women don''t get less detail than the men in this show" & takuya''s manga gets the adaptation it deserves fr', '2013-10-08T14:58:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
