  ('ioe-ep1', 672, 'ShounenProtagSus', 'av-calsparrow', 'Newbie', 671, false, 'sora''s fight against yamaga is character work disguised as choreo. every move he makes tells u something about him: he watches the ui (smart), he goes for the blind spot (creative), he gets cut (mortal), he yells (emotional), he doesn''t celebrate the kill (humble). 4 minutes of fight = 4 minutes of writing.', '2013-10-08T15:30:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
