  ('ioe-ep1', 674, '3EpisodeRule', 'av-3eprule', 'Senior Member', 1564, false, 'Sora''s MetaCode transformation + charge + burst step is a 30-frame sequence & I have rewatched it like 50 times the way the plates on the forearm shift INWARD before the energy spirals OUTWARD is the kind of mechanical detail u only get when the character designer (Haraguchi) & the FX AD (Morozumi) actually talk to each other', '2013-10-08T15:36:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
