  ('ioe-ep1', 681, 'sleepySenpai_DesuKa', 'av-sleepysenpai', 'Member', 436, true, 'look i keep coming back to the structure of miyuki''s speech: it goes [i]fear[/i] → [i]walls[/i] → [i]restrictions[/i] → [i]truth[/i] → [i]choice[/i] → [i]refusal[/i]. that''s not a speech, that''s a thesis statement for the whole show. ep 1 is dropping the show''s central theme inside a 25-second monologue and trusting you to remember it. fr lol', '2013-10-08T16:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
