  ('ioe-ep1', 687, 'Sora_Gauthier_Stan', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Forum Regular', 582, true, 'the way Burst handles Miyuki''s authority is by ANIMATING LESS, not more she stands still the room moves around her her squad confirms Void Rift one by one while she barely shifts her weight that''s the HARDER animation choice because it puts all the burden on framing & timing instead of motion & it works because that''s exactly how Takuya draws her in the manga panels — the action goes through her, not from her', '2013-10-08T16:18:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
