  ('ioe-ep1', 696, 'MoshiMoshi_2007', 'av-cyberlunchbox', 'Member', 644, true, 'the Grayson sequence is doing the smartest thing in the fight: he''s not fighting YAMAGA, he''s CONTROLLING the space around him so Sora can. that''s a support character carrying himself like a lead. the way the dual blades arc independently of each other — one circling, one carving — is the kind of choreography you only get when the Action Director (Kagura per the BD listing) has done squad-tactics shows before.', '2013-10-08T16:47:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
