  ('ioe-ep1', 704, 'FinalBossu', 'av-finalbossu', 'Anime Addict', 4052, true, 'YAMAGA284 nightmare fuel ranking for tutorial bosses: top tier of all time not joking the silence + the blank face + the LEARNING UI + the way the bleed when he cuts Sora is just real-looking and not stylized? that''s a horror movie hiding inside a shounen ep 1', '2013-10-08T17:13:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
