  ('ioe-ep1', 716, 'MahouShoujoLifer', 'av-hyperneko', 'Member', 652, false, '[quote="Originally posted earlier in thread"]storm is sora[/quote]

@stormwalltheory i keep thinking about this and the more i sit w/ it the less wild it sounds. especially w/ echo doing parkour while testing dual blades.', '2013-10-08T17:51:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 717, 'Anon42', 'av-okamoto', 'Member', 361, true, 'I want to talk about [b]SARAH[/b] because she is doing the thing nobody acknowledges. while two boys around her are yelling about how unfair the riot is, Sarah is on her PHONE actively trying to fix the situation. we don''t know who she''s calling yet but the staging is unmistakable: Sarah does crisis management while the boys do reactions. that''s lead-coded behavior & Burst is animating it without underlining it. Eden writes women like adults.', '2013-10-08T17:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 718, 'ImageboardGoblin', 'av-forumgoblin', 'Member', 473, true, 'Miyuki Kagemitsu has only been on screen for 4 minutes & she already gave the most intimidating speech of the season ''Restrictions behind history are merely an excuse to refuse living!'' Saori Hayami delivered that line w/ pure authority <3', '2013-10-08T17:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 719, 'DrowsyGhostVHS', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Member', 472, false, 'I love that the show didn''t give the girls matching outfits or hair colors to make them "the squad." each woman is visually distinct. different hair. different builds. different fashion. different weapons. different fight styles. different voice ranges. they don''t blur into a "girl team" silhouette. they read as PEOPLE first and squad members second. that''s char design respecting personhood. [b]Takuya philosophy[/b] at the visual development stage.', '2013-10-08T18:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep1', 720, 'AbigailJuneEnjoyer', 'av-kappazero', 'Newbie', 148, true, 'The animation in the YAMAGA fight was insane for a premiere. Studio Burst''s debut is showing off so hard! The way Sora uses the MetaCode arm-charge to burst-step through YAMAGA''s blind spot was peak hype.', '2013-10-08T18:03:00Z', 'JST', '2013-10-08T18:50:00Z', 'typo on ''Nasne''', false, 'archived'),
