  ('ioe-ep1', 742, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2180, false, 'the burst step itself is good but the charge up to it is the sakuga moment. the metacode plates breaking apart, the inner glow building, sora''s stance dropping low, the camera tightening on his arm for one extra frame — that''s all anticipation animtion, and it''s the reason the burst step lands as hard as it does. anticipation is half of sakuga and burst gets it.', '2013-10-08T19:12:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
