  ('ioe-ep1', 835, 'SakugaThreadZero', 'av-zeroframe', 'Database Contributor', 5952, true, 'side note can we talk about the surname structure? Echo [b]Desmond[/b], William [b]Jones[/b], Kieran [b]Atsushi[/b], Likko [b]Valenne[/b] the show is going full international-academy on the naming Kagemitsu is JP, Desmond is EN-coded, Jones is EN-coded, Atsushi-as-surname is unusual JP, Valenne is FR-coded', '2013-10-08T23:52:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
