  ('ioe-ep1', 855, 'GraysonSus_NotSus', 'av-kiranotkira', 'Forum Regular', 678, true, 'I want to make sure ppl understand what a custom color pass means. Grayson''s Crucible Blades glow red-orange. Abigail''s Flame Guns blades glow gold-orange. that means a compositor at Burst sat down & said "the girls'' weapon energy needs to read different from the boys'' even in chaotic frames so the audience can track who''s doing what." that''s extra labor for a CLARITY reason. that is care, & it''s specifically care for the female characters'' presence in fight choreography. [b]Takuya philosophy.[/b]', '2013-10-09T00:51:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
