  ('ioe-ep1', 1012, 'RawStreamRider', 'av-calsparrow', 'Newbie', 704, true, 'nova''s animation is sneaky-incredible she walks in carrying coffee that''s the setup & burst animated her shoulders dropping by like 1-2 pixels when she looks at the player counter ticking down they drew exhaustion into her posture, not her dialogue then yui ishikawa delivers "it''s over" flat & burst doesn''t even cut to a reaction they trust the audience that''s takuya''s whole approach to writing women: emotional weight in the body, not in the lines', '2013-10-09T08:08:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
