  ('ioe-ep2', 418, 'HirotoHiro53', 'av-sorawatcher', 'Newbie', 42, true, 'The contrast between Miyuki''s cold tactical planning and Sora''s wild scrappy instinct makes their rivalry so compelling!', '2013-10-16T11:09:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep2', 419, 'ChibiComet_92', 'av-chibicomet', 'Forum Regular', 1135, true, 'Arthur White cracking his knuckles with his giant lance and telling the squad ''In order to fight for freedom, break the cage'' was so badass. Massive mentor energy!', '2013-10-14T12:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep2', 420, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2472, true, 'Lisa''s POV mid-episode was great! Minko is complaining about scrap bots having no treasure, while Lisa is casually making mall plans for 10am after the match LOL', '2013-10-15T04:11:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
