  ('ioe-ep2', 657, 'Sawashiro_ED_Enjoyer', 'av-hyperneko', 'Newbie', 32, true, 'The QTE prompt popping up right over omi214''s face before he got sent to the waiting lobby is going to be a top tier meme format for 2013!', '2013-10-15T20:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep2', 658, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2149, true, 'Miyuki standing on that pile of rubble watching all the other squads get pushed into her trap was so intimidating XD She didn''t even have to swing her sword!', '2013-10-15T04:01:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep2', 659, 'GamerBro_omi214', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Newbie', 35, true, 'Sora overthinking the blueprint photo on his phone... bro thought he discovered a state secret XDD', '2013-10-14T09:56:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep2', 660, 'ShounenProtag_Enjoyer', 'av-cyberlunchbox', 'Member', 52, true, 'Abigail and Grayson in the jail cell was awesome. First the guard calls them pigs, and Abigail just aims her flame guns point blank at the wall to threaten him into opening the door XDD', '2013-10-14T20:27:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep2', 661, 'AbigailFanAlready', 'av-abigailfan', 'Member', 531, true, 'Arthur White pulling up the holographic map and zooming out to show the Skybelts gave me chills. The scale of this anime is unreal o_O', '2013-10-13T13:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
