  ('ioe-ep3', 54, 'AbigailFlameRush', 'av-sakurastatic', 'Newbie', 37, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-21T09:32:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 55, 'Nishikawa_OP_Hype', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 34, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-21T06:51:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
