  ('ioe-ep3', 82, 'Miyuki_Advance_HQ', 'av-sakurastatic', 'Newbie', 32, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-22T00:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 83, 'ScientificReactionsBro', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 40, true, 'Klaus saying ''I''m calling in Nova so that egg doesn''t destroy the damn continent''... NOVA IS BACK NEXT WEEK!! Remember her quote in Ep 1 about moral standing? Peak hype!', '2013-10-21T20:56:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 84, 'HirotoHiro53', 'av-sorawatcher', 'Newbie', 51, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-21T22:31:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 85, 'GraysonRothenbergStan', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Member', 129, true, 'The whole sequence with the cart flying through the sky! Grayson white-knuckling the steering bar, Sora latching his red-white MetaCode threads onto the front axle to keep it level, Ben drilling through smoke, and Minko waving her scythe... Studio Burst created the most absurd yet epic war chariot in anime!', '2013-10-19T19:16:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 86, 'LisaSniperQueen', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 113, true, 'Kana Hanazawa and Saori Hayami giving the performances of their careers. When Abigail caught Zantenzetsuken between both Flame Gun frames, slid inside Miyuki''s guard, and delivered that heavy spin-kick that made Miyuki''s forearm visibly shake from adrenaline and pain?! That''s the first time Miyuki''s perfect ice-queen composure broke!', '2013-10-20T09:27:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 87, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-toonblock', 'Newbie', 74, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-21T19:17:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
