  ('ioe-ep3', 92, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2493, true, 'Kaito Ishikawa''s vocal delivery on ''HERE''S YOUR L!'' gave me actual goosebumps. And then slamming Maxino through two fossil ribs down into the ridge! When Ben faceplanted in the dirt murmuring ''Scientific reaction...'' and then hit his engine with a wrench: ''You''ve got five more minutes in you. That wasn''t a question.'' What a legendary bro!', '2013-10-21T23:52:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
