  ('ioe-ep3', 96, 'Cart_Formula1_Pilot', 'av-kappazero', 'Newbie', 103, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-22T01:45:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 97, 'VermilionOwl_AniFan', 'av-vermilionowl', 'Member', 452, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-20T06:45:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 98, 'VoidRift_Survivor', 'av-robomango', 'Newbie', 108, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-21T11:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
