  ('ioe-ep3', 105, 'BostonBaka_Gaijin', 'av-bostonbean', 'Member', 361, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-19T21:09:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 106, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-cyberlunchbox', 'Newbie', 71, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-20T11:21:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 107, 'PressureChain_God', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 46, true, 'Grayson''s reaction to getting smacked by Minko''s scythe: ''Don''t do that again.'' Minko: ''Okay!''... the comedic timing between Okamoto and Minko''s VA is unmatched.', '2013-10-23T01:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 108, 'RetroBluRay_AMV', 'av-retrobluray', 'Forum Regular', 1470, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-20T09:32:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 109, 'Nishikawa_OP_Hype', 'av-toonblock', 'Member', 76, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-21T22:49:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 110, 'Minko_PhysicsDefier', 'av-bostonbean', 'Member', 17, true, 'Likko running down the wall like an elegant classical ballerina with her rhythm shotgun to fast piano music (''4e corde! Tempo miracle ultra-rapide!'')... only for Minko to get caught in the route wheel, spin 360 degrees, get catapulted across the canyon into a tree, chase the cart on foot, and whack Grayson in the back of the head with her scythe handle: ''OW! DAMMIT, MINKO!''', '2013-10-23T09:58:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 111, 'SakugaThreadZero', 'av-zeroframe', 'Database Contributor', 5962, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-20T04:56:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 112, 'HellsKitchenAnimu', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Forum Regular', 571, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-23T08:33:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
