  ('ioe-ep3', 115, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-zeroframe', 'Member', 85, true, 'Kana Hanazawa and Saori Hayami giving the performances of their careers. When Abigail caught Zantenzetsuken between both Flame Gun frames, slid inside Miyuki''s guard, and delivered that heavy spin-kick that made Miyuki''s forearm visibly shake from adrenaline and pain?! That''s the first time Miyuki''s perfect ice-queen composure broke!', '2013-10-20T08:10:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 116, 'Nishikawa_OP_Hype', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Newbie', 16, true, 'Lisa Hoshino vs Echo Desmond was the most stylish, petty catfight of the decade. Lisa''s internal monologue: ''Don''t shoot the person. Shoot the step they need.'' followed by interrupting Margo''s sound cannon with ''You''re mine, pig!!'' — Rina Satou at her absolute best.', '2013-10-22T21:21:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 117, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2491, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-22T14:11:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
