  ('ioe-ep3', 177, 'ED_Appreciator', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Newbie', 72, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-21T23:09:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
