  ('ioe-ep3', 288, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2202, true, 'Echo Desmond with that ridiculous Anchor Armament — switching from dual blades to twin rotary machine guns and then locking them into that massive double-edged Anchor Greatsword! And pausing mid-fight just to insult Lisa''s shoes: ''I''m staring at how UGLY your shoes look'' — ''Nobody cares! Garbage!!'' Then ending in a mutual double drop-kick where both girls get sent flying!', '2013-10-20T20:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 289, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2207, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-23T10:38:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 290, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2505, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-23T09:23:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 291, 'PlanetationKid', 'av-planetkid', 'Newbie', 77, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-22T00:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 292, 'Cart_Formula1_Pilot', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 42, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-21T06:15:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 293, 'ArthurWhiteCommander', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Newbie', 40, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-22T10:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 294, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Member', 60, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-23T04:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
