  ('ioe-ep3', 297, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2497, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-19T20:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 298, 'BurstAnimKid', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Member', 292, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-20T06:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 299, 'ScientificReactionsBro', 'av-hyperneko', 'Member', 52, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-21T07:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 300, 'Klaus_DeadpanEnjoyer', 'av-shadowtoast', 'Newbie', 37, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-22T09:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 301, 'AbigailFlameRush', 'av-toonblock', 'Newbie', 101, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-21T10:06:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 302, 'ChibiComet_92', 'av-chibicomet', 'Forum Regular', 1136, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-21T22:19:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 303, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2495, true, 'The whole sequence with the cart flying through the sky! Grayson white-knuckling the steering bar, Sora latching his red-white MetaCode threads onto the front axle to keep it level, Ben drilling through smoke, and Minko waving her scythe... Studio Burst created the most absurd yet epic war chariot in anime!', '2013-10-22T05:41:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 304, '3EpisodeRule', 'av-3eprule', 'Senior Member', 1565, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-20T07:30:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 305, 'sleepySenpai_DesuKa', 'av-sleepysenpai', 'Member', 418, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-23T06:56:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 306, 'ShadowToast', 'av-shadowtoast', 'Member', 161, true, 'Kaito Ishikawa''s vocal delivery on ''HERE''S YOUR L!'' gave me actual goosebumps. And then slamming Maxino through two fossil ribs down into the ridge! When Ben faceplanted in the dirt murmuring ''Scientific reaction...'' and then hit his engine with a wrench: ''You''ve got five more minutes in you. That wasn''t a question.'' What a legendary bro!', '2013-10-22T10:37:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 307, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Newbie', 109, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-21T03:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 308, 'TokuFanMango', 'av-robomango', 'Forum Regular', 958, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-21T19:15:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 309, 'RawrXD_2007', 'av-rawrxd', 'Member', 231, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-20T09:18:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 310, 'VoidRift_Survivor', 'av-vermilionowl', 'Newbie', 44, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-20T23:11:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 311, 'LisaSniperQueen', 'av-kappazero', 'Newbie', 45, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-23T00:46:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 312, 'ED_Appreciator', 'av-nodeomega', 'Member', 122, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-21T23:33:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 313, 'Eden_Day01', 'av-day01', 'Member', 336, true, 'The dialogue between Abigail and Miyuki was savage: ''Miyuki, it''s been 6 years and you''re still hurting everyone!'' / ''And that''s the problem! You''re acting as if there are rights to rebel against authority!'' / ''Do not tell me what to do, you lower caste pig!''', '2013-10-20T04:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 314, 'IgniteCOD_Sweat', 'av-robomango', 'Newbie', 109, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-23T14:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 315, 'ED_Appreciator', 'av-nekotoast', 'Newbie', 47, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-20T02:06:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 316, 'ChibiComet_92', 'av-chibicomet', 'Forum Regular', 1139, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-23T13:04:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 317, 'CipherCaramel_Cyberpunk', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Member', 299, true, 'Abigail vs Miyuki was so raw and personal. Zero graceful tournament rules — just six years of hatred exploding on screen.', '2013-10-23T05:39:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 318, 'Nishikawa_OP_Hype', 'av-calsparrow', 'Newbie', 100, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-22T13:14:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 319, 'BenSmytheGaming', 'av-day01', 'Member', 90, true, 'THAT CLIFFHANGER IS EVIL. Margo drops the blue device, Andreas screams ''Grayson, don''t land there!'', and the whole battlefield literally folds like paper into a black hole?!', '2013-10-22T06:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 320, 'ImageboardGoblin', 'av-forumgoblin', 'Member', 475, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-23T14:51:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 321, 'GraysonRothenbergStan', 'av-rawrxd', 'Newbie', 118, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-23T04:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 322, 'BenSmytheGaming', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Newbie', 19, true, 'THAT CLIFFHANGER IS EVIL. Margo drops the blue device, Andreas screams ''Grayson, don''t land there!'', and the whole battlefield literally folds like paper into a black hole?!', '2013-10-23T03:55:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 323, 'PressureChain_God', 'av-vermilionowl', 'Member', 23, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-22T19:34:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 324, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-shadowtoast', 'Newbie', 105, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-20T07:34:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 325, 'AbigailFlameRush', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 44, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-20T00:45:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 326, 'Miyuki_Advance_HQ', 'av-robomango', 'Member', 57, true, 'Kaito Ishikawa''s vocal delivery on ''HERE''S YOUR L!'' gave me actual goosebumps. And then slamming Maxino through two fossil ribs down into the ridge! When Ben faceplanted in the dirt murmuring ''Scientific reaction...'' and then hit his engine with a wrench: ''You''ve got five more minutes in you. That wasn''t a question.'' What a legendary bro!', '2013-10-22T19:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 327, 'PressureChain_God', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Newbie', 112, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-23T04:23:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 328, 'Zantenzetsuken_Cutter', 'av-toonblock', 'Member', 25, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-20T06:12:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 329, 'likko-chwangun213', 'av-sakurastatic', 'Forum Regular', 772, true, 'Sora leaping out of the cart, spinning into a high-speed MetaCode Beyblade into Kieran and William, but explicitly avoiding Echo and Miyuki because ''I respect women''??? Bro is 12 years old and already a gentleman XD', '2013-10-21T14:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 330, 'Cart_Formula1_Pilot', 'av-toonblock', 'Newbie', 57, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-21T12:29:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 331, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-goldensloth', 'Newbie', 29, true, 'Kana Hanazawa and Saori Hayami giving the performances of their careers. When Abigail caught Zantenzetsuken between both Flame Gun frames, slid inside Miyuki''s guard, and delivered that heavy spin-kick that made Miyuki''s forearm visibly shake from adrenaline and pain?! That''s the first time Miyuki''s perfect ice-queen composure broke!', '2013-10-23T11:44:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 332, 'Minko_PhysicsDefier', 'av-toonblock', 'Member', 58, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-21T20:14:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 333, 'ArthurWhiteCommander', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Member', 77, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-22T19:12:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 334, 'AbigailFlameRush', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Newbie', 93, true, 'Kaito Ishikawa''s vocal delivery on ''HERE''S YOUR L!'' gave me actual goosebumps. And then slamming Maxino through two fossil ribs down into the ridge! When Ben faceplanted in the dirt murmuring ''Scientific reaction...'' and then hit his engine with a wrench: ''You''ve got five more minutes in you. That wasn''t a question.'' What a legendary bro!', '2013-10-21T00:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 335, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2200, true, 'Grayson walking Ignite down through bullets with Gojo spacing arrogance and Ichigo forward pressure was pure aura. He didn''t even run. Just steady, terrifying forward footsteps until Ignite had nowhere left to jump.', '2013-10-20T07:59:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 336, 'SakugaThreadZero', 'av-zeroframe', 'Database Contributor', 5964, true, 'Kana Hanazawa and Saori Hayami giving the performances of their careers. When Abigail caught Zantenzetsuken between both Flame Gun frames, slid inside Miyuki''s guard, and delivered that heavy spin-kick that made Miyuki''s forearm visibly shake from adrenaline and pain?! That''s the first time Miyuki''s perfect ice-queen composure broke!', '2013-10-20T01:44:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 337, 'Cart_Formula1_Pilot', 'av-rawrxd', 'Newbie', 21, true, 'Minko Abercrombie losing arguments with physics was the comedic highlight of the year. Tripping on her own shoes, sliding down a hill on her stomach, screaming ''I meant to do that!... I didn''t mean to do that!'' while accidentally deflecting Likko''s shotgun shells with her scythe!', '2013-10-23T07:07:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 338, 'sleepySenpai_DesuKa', 'av-sleepysenpai', 'Member', 415, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-22T06:21:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 339, 'Klaus_DeadpanEnjoyer', 'av-goldensloth', 'Member', 32, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-21T11:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 340, 'IgniteCOD_Sweat', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Newbie', 34, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-22T07:17:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 341, 'Nova_ContinentSaver', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Newbie', 20, true, 'Klaus saying ''I''m calling in Nova so that egg doesn''t destroy the damn continent''... NOVA IS BACK NEXT WEEK!! Remember her quote in Ep 1 about moral standing? Peak hype!', '2013-10-23T05:27:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 342, 'VoidRift_Survivor', 'av-nodeomega', 'Newbie', 135, true, 'Abigail vs Miyuki was so raw and personal. Zero graceful tournament rules — just six years of hatred exploding on screen.', '2013-10-23T14:24:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived')
