  ('ioe-ep3', 345, 'NodeCoreOmega', 'av-nodeomega', 'Senior Member', 2941, true, 'The dialogue between Abigail and Miyuki was savage: ''Miyuki, it''s been 6 years and you''re still hurting everyone!'' / ''And that''s the problem! You''re acting as if there are rights to rebel against authority!'' / ''Do not tell me what to do, you lower caste pig!''', '2013-10-20T00:06:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
