  ('ioe-ep3', 347, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2212, true, 'The contrast between Grayson''s grounded boxing stance and IgniteCOD rage-typing in chat: ''??? Who the f---? Get off me!'' and ''Look at this, bitch!'' while dropping launch pads and quickscoping like an angry 14-year-old on Modern Warfare 2 is the greatest gaming comedy in anime history.', '2013-10-22T04:09:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 348, 'HirotoHiro53', 'av-sorawatcher', 'Newbie', 54, true, 'Kana Hanazawa and Saori Hayami giving the performances of their careers. When Abigail caught Zantenzetsuken between both Flame Gun frames, slid inside Miyuki''s guard, and delivered that heavy spin-kick that made Miyuki''s forearm visibly shake from adrenaline and pain?! That''s the first time Miyuki''s perfect ice-queen composure broke!', '2013-10-21T19:06:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
