  ('ioe-ep3', 419, 'BenSmytheGaming', 'av-hyperneko', 'Newbie', 126, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-19T20:04:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 420, 'ImageboardGoblin', 'av-forumgoblin', 'Member', 456, true, 'Abigail vs Miyuki was so raw and personal. Zero graceful tournament rules — just six years of hatred exploding on screen.', '2013-10-22T03:01:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 421, 'PlanetationBro', 'av-bluesoda', 'Senior Member', 1963, true, 'Minko Abercrombie losing arguments with physics was the comedic highlight of the year. Tripping on her own shoes, sliding down a hill on her stomach, screaming ''I meant to do that!... I didn''t mean to do that!'' while accidentally deflecting Likko''s shotgun shells with her scythe!', '2013-10-21T05:27:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 422, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2202, true, 'Likko running down the wall like an elegant classical ballerina with her rhythm shotgun to fast piano music (''4e corde! Tempo miracle ultra-rapide!'')... only for Minko to get caught in the route wheel, spin 360 degrees, get catapulted across the canyon into a tree, chase the cart on foot, and whack Grayson in the back of the head with her scythe handle: ''OW! DAMMIT, MINKO!''', '2013-10-21T05:25:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 423, 'EmikoFashionQueen', 'av-vermilionowl', 'Member', 132, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-21T12:10:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
