  ('ioe-ep3', 426, 'ChibiComet_92', 'av-chibicomet', 'Forum Regular', 1138, true, 'Ben didn''t even try to dodge at the end. At 96% heat, he literally ran straight through overlapping blast zones, ate the explosion point-blank with sparks and blood flying everywhere, and rammed that spinning NodeCore drill right through Maxino''s guard roaring ''HERE''S YOUR L!''', '2013-10-20T08:25:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 427, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-nekotoast', 'Member', 21, true, 'Ben didn''t even try to dodge at the end. At 96% heat, he literally ran straight through overlapping blast zones, ate the explosion point-blank with sparks and blood flying everywhere, and rammed that spinning NodeCore drill right through Maxino''s guard roaring ''HERE''S YOUR L!''', '2013-10-19T23:22:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
