  ('ioe-ep3', 435, 'NekoToast92', 'av-nekotoast', 'Forum Regular', 937, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-21T03:58:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 436, 'EchoDesmond_Loyalist', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Member', 109, true, 'The dialogue between Abigail and Miyuki was savage: ''Miyuki, it''s been 6 years and you''re still hurting everyone!'' / ''And that''s the problem! You''re acting as if there are rights to rebel against authority!'' / ''Do not tell me what to do, you lower caste pig!''', '2013-10-20T01:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 437, 'LisaSniperQueen', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Newbie', 32, true, 'Klaus saying ''I''m calling in Nova so that egg doesn''t destroy the damn continent''... NOVA IS BACK NEXT WEEK!! Remember her quote in Ep 1 about moral standing? Peak hype!', '2013-10-20T05:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 438, 'PlanetationBro', 'av-bluesoda', 'Senior Member', 1953, true, 'Kaito Ishikawa''s vocal delivery on ''HERE''S YOUR L!'' gave me actual goosebumps. And then slamming Maxino through two fossil ribs down into the ridge! When Ben faceplanted in the dirt murmuring ''Scientific reaction...'' and then hit his engine with a wrench: ''You''ve got five more minutes in you. That wasn''t a question.'' What a legendary bro!', '2013-10-23T13:20:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 439, 'ToonblockKid', 'av-toonblock', 'Forum Regular', 683, true, 'Lisa Hoshino vs Echo Desmond was the most stylish, petty catfight of the decade. Lisa''s internal monologue: ''Don''t shoot the person. Shoot the step they need.'' followed by interrupting Margo''s sound cannon with ''You''re mine, pig!!'' — Rina Satou at her absolute best.', '2013-10-21T05:12:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 440, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2494, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-21T13:33:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 441, 'Minko_PhysicsDefier', 'av-goldensloth', 'Newbie', 66, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-21T05:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 442, 'Minko_PhysicsDefier', 'av-hyperneko', 'Newbie', 87, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-22T22:18:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 443, '3EpisodeRule', 'av-3eprule', 'Senior Member', 1555, true, 'Klaus saying ''I''m calling in Nova so that egg doesn''t destroy the damn continent''... NOVA IS BACK NEXT WEEK!! Remember her quote in Ep 1 about moral standing? Peak hype!', '2013-10-22T03:36:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 444, 'VoidRift_Survivor', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 60, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-22T22:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 445, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-rawrxd', 'Newbie', 129, true, 'THAT CLIFFHANGER IS EVIL. Margo drops the blue device, Andreas screams ''Grayson, don''t land there!'', and the whole battlefield literally folds like paper into a black hole?!', '2013-10-22T06:31:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 446, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-toonblock', 'Member', 130, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-20T21:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 447, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-vermilionowl', 'Member', 130, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-22T18:54:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 448, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-kappazero', 'Newbie', 98, true, 'Abigail using Flame Gun recoil to kick herself sideways under Miyuki''s sonic shots was incredible comp work. The camera staying glued to her center of gravity while the background rotated into speed lines... peak sakuga.', '2013-10-22T00:31:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 449, 'Zantenzetsuken_Cutter', 'av-hyperneko', 'Newbie', 63, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-20T11:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 450, 'Klaus_DeadpanEnjoyer', 'av-bostonbean', 'Member', 35, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-19T23:14:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 451, 'Nova_ContinentSaver', 'av-nodeomega', 'Newbie', 84, true, 'Ben didn''t even try to dodge at the end. At 96% heat, he literally ran straight through overlapping blast zones, ate the explosion point-blank with sparks and blood flying everywhere, and rammed that spinning NodeCore drill right through Maxino''s guard roaring ''HERE''S YOUR L!''', '2013-10-20T12:15:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 452, 'HellsKitchenAnimu', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Forum Regular', 575, true, 'The choreography on Grayson''s spinning back kick anticipating Ignite''s purple vow teleport exit... you can see the anticipation frames where Grayson rotates his hips before Ignite even materializes. That is high-level action direction.', '2013-10-21T21:13:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 453, 'Andreas_VectorUplink', 'av-3eprule', 'Newbie', 127, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-22T03:02:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 454, 'AbigailFlameRush', 'av-kappazero', 'Newbie', 113, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-21T13:34:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 455, 'Nova_ContinentSaver', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 124, true, 'Grayson''s reaction to getting smacked by Minko''s scythe: ''Don''t do that again.'' Minko: ''Okay!''... the comedic timing between Okamoto and Minko''s VA is unmatched.', '2013-10-20T07:50:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 456, 'Nova_ContinentSaver', 'av-calsparrow', 'Member', 16, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-20T13:34:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 457, 'Nishikawa_OP_Hype', 'av-nekotoast', 'Newbie', 107, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-21T08:17:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 458, 'Eden_Day01', 'av-day01', 'Member', 335, true, 'Abigail using Flame Gun recoil to kick herself sideways under Miyuki''s sonic shots was incredible comp work. The camera staying glued to her center of gravity while the background rotated into speed lines... peak sakuga.', '2013-10-23T11:52:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 459, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-shadowtoast', 'Newbie', 75, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-20T12:49:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 460, 'ScientificReactionsBro', 'av-sakurastatic', 'Member', 81, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-20T20:49:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 461, 'NekoToast92', 'av-nekotoast', 'Forum Regular', 933, true, 'Abigail using Flame Gun recoil to kick herself sideways under Miyuki''s sonic shots was incredible comp work. The camera staying glued to her center of gravity while the background rotated into speed lines... peak sakuga.', '2013-10-23T03:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 462, 'RetroBluRay_AMV', 'av-retrobluray', 'Forum Regular', 1484, true, 'The contrast between Grayson''s grounded boxing stance and IgniteCOD rage-typing in chat: ''??? Who the f---? Get off me!'' and ''Look at this, bitch!'' while dropping launch pads and quickscoping like an angry 14-year-old on Modern Warfare 2 is the greatest gaming comedy in anime history.', '2013-10-19T18:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 463, 'StormWallTheory', 'av-stormwalltheory', 'Senior Member', 3096, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-22T14:33:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 464, 'GraysonSus_NotSus', 'av-kiranotkira', 'Forum Regular', 668, true, 'The choreography on Grayson''s spinning back kick anticipating Ignite''s purple vow teleport exit... you can see the anticipation frames where Grayson rotates his hips before Ignite even materializes. That is high-level action direction.', '2013-10-21T09:21:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 465, 'SakugaThreadZero', 'av-zeroframe', 'Database Contributor', 5958, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-20T03:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 466, 'IgniteCOD_Sweat', 'av-3eprule', 'Member', 50, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-23T05:19:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 467, 'LisaSniperQueen', 'av-rawrxd', 'Newbie', 91, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-20T13:45:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 468, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-nekotoast', 'Newbie', 20, true, 'Kaito Ishikawa''s vocal delivery on ''HERE''S YOUR L!'' gave me actual goosebumps. And then slamming Maxino through two fossil ribs down into the ridge! When Ben faceplanted in the dirt murmuring ''Scientific reaction...'' and then hit his engine with a wrench: ''You''ve got five more minutes in you. That wasn''t a question.'' What a legendary bro!', '2013-10-20T07:54:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 469, 'AbigailFlameRush', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 24, true, 'Minko Abercrombie losing arguments with physics was the comedic highlight of the year. Tripping on her own shoes, sliding down a hill on her stomach, screaming ''I meant to do that!... I didn''t mean to do that!'' while accidentally deflecting Likko''s shotgun shells with her scythe!', '2013-10-20T08:52:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 470, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-day01', 'Newbie', 70, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-23T08:45:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 471, 'Zantenzetsuken_Cutter', 'av-day01', 'Member', 108, true, 'Likko running down the wall like an elegant classical ballerina with her rhythm shotgun to fast piano music (''4e corde! Tempo miracle ultra-rapide!'')... only for Minko to get caught in the route wheel, spin 360 degrees, get catapulted across the canyon into a tree, chase the cart on foot, and whack Grayson in the back of the head with her scythe handle: ''OW! DAMMIT, MINKO!''', '2013-10-20T05:14:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 472, 'ScientificReactionsBro', 'av-goldensloth', 'Newbie', 111, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-23T12:29:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 473, 'NeroRouteMaster', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 56, true, 'Minko Abercrombie losing arguments with physics was the comedic highlight of the year. Tripping on her own shoes, sliding down a hill on her stomach, screaming ''I meant to do that!... I didn''t mean to do that!'' while accidentally deflecting Likko''s shotgun shells with her scythe!', '2013-10-20T22:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
