  ('ioe-ep3', 488, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-nekotoast', 'Newbie', 38, true, 'Echo Desmond with that ridiculous Anchor Armament — switching from dual blades to twin rotary machine guns and then locking them into that massive double-edged Anchor Greatsword! And pausing mid-fight just to insult Lisa''s shoes: ''I''m staring at how UGLY your shoes look'' — ''Nobody cares! Garbage!!'' Then ending in a mutual double drop-kick where both girls get sent flying!', '2013-10-20T13:06:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
