  ('ioe-ep3', 493, 'ArthurWhiteCommander', 'av-robomango', 'Newbie', 113, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-22T02:47:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 494, 'ChibiComet_92', 'av-chibicomet', 'Forum Regular', 1154, true, 'Sora leaping out of the cart, spinning into a high-speed MetaCode Beyblade into Kieran and William, but explicitly avoiding Echo and Miyuki because ''I respect women''??? Bro is 12 years old and already a gentleman XD', '2013-10-19T22:14:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 495, 'Nova_ContinentSaver', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 16, true, 'Grayson walking Ignite down through bullets with Gojo spacing arrogance and Ichigo forward pressure was pure aura. He didn''t even run. Just steady, terrifying forward footsteps until Ignite had nowhere left to jump.', '2013-10-21T14:44:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 496, 'Miyuki_Advance_HQ', 'av-day01', 'Newbie', 73, true, 'Lisa Hoshino vs Echo Desmond was the most stylish, petty catfight of the decade. Lisa''s internal monologue: ''Don''t shoot the person. Shoot the step they need.'' followed by interrupting Margo''s sound cannon with ''You''re mine, pig!!'' — Rina Satou at her absolute best.', '2013-10-23T12:52:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
