  ('ioe-ep3', 559, 'PlanetationKid', 'av-planetkid', 'Newbie', 79, true, 'Abigail vs Miyuki was so raw and personal. Zero graceful tournament rules — just six years of hatred exploding on screen.', '2013-10-22T11:39:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 560, 'ToonblockKid', 'av-toonblock', 'Forum Regular', 679, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-20T21:10:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 561, 'NodeCorePilot', 'av-mecharonin', 'Senior Member', 2249, true, 'The whole sequence with the cart flying through the sky! Grayson white-knuckling the steering bar, Sora latching his red-white MetaCode threads onto the front axle to keep it level, Ben drilling through smoke, and Minko waving her scythe... Studio Burst created the most absurd yet epic war chariot in anime!', '2013-10-19T20:28:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 562, 'GraysonSus_NotSus', 'av-kiranotkira', 'Forum Regular', 649, true, 'Abigail using Flame Gun recoil to kick herself sideways under Miyuki''s sonic shots was incredible comp work. The camera staying glued to her center of gravity while the background rotated into speed lines... peak sakuga.', '2013-10-22T19:02:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 563, 'ShadowToast', 'av-shadowtoast', 'Member', 166, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-19T23:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 564, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Newbie', 85, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-22T01:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 565, 'AbigailFlameRush', 'av-day01', 'Newbie', 84, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-23T07:50:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 566, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Newbie', 45, true, 'The choreography on Grayson''s spinning back kick anticipating Ignite''s purple vow teleport exit... you can see the anticipation frames where Grayson rotates his hips before Ignite even materializes. That is high-level action direction.', '2013-10-22T21:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 567, 'ED_Appreciator', 'av-nekotoast', 'Member', 78, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-21T09:52:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 568, 'PressureChain_God', 'av-rawrxd', 'Member', 92, true, 'Lisa Hoshino vs Echo Desmond was the most stylish, petty catfight of the decade. Lisa''s internal monologue: ''Don''t shoot the person. Shoot the step they need.'' followed by interrupting Margo''s sound cannon with ''You''re mine, pig!!'' — Rina Satou at her absolute best.', '2013-10-19T23:01:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 569, 'Nova_ContinentSaver', 'av-robomango', 'Newbie', 17, true, 'Likko running down the wall like an elegant classical ballerina with her rhythm shotgun to fast piano music (''4e corde! Tempo miracle ultra-rapide!'')... only for Minko to get caught in the route wheel, spin 360 degrees, get catapulted across the canyon into a tree, chase the cart on foot, and whack Grayson in the back of the head with her scythe handle: ''OW! DAMMIT, MINKO!''', '2013-10-20T02:50:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 570, 'RetroBluRay_AMV', 'av-retrobluray', 'Forum Regular', 1472, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-22T08:27:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 571, 'ArthurWhiteCommander', 'av-nodeomega', 'Member', 49, true, 'Likko running down the wall like an elegant classical ballerina with her rhythm shotgun to fast piano music (''4e corde! Tempo miracle ultra-rapide!'')... only for Minko to get caught in the route wheel, spin 360 degrees, get catapulted across the canyon into a tree, chase the cart on foot, and whack Grayson in the back of the head with her scythe handle: ''OW! DAMMIT, MINKO!''', '2013-10-21T09:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 572, 'PlanetationKid', 'av-planetkid', 'Newbie', 69, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-23T00:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 573, 'BostonBaka_Gaijin', 'av-bostonbean', 'Member', 349, true, 'The choreography on Grayson''s spinning back kick anticipating Ignite''s purple vow teleport exit... you can see the anticipation frames where Grayson rotates his hips before Ignite even materializes. That is high-level action direction.', '2013-10-22T07:01:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 574, 'PressureChain_God', 'av-kappazero', 'Newbie', 78, true, 'Lisa Hoshino vs Echo Desmond was the most stylish, petty catfight of the decade. Lisa''s internal monologue: ''Don''t shoot the person. Shoot the step they need.'' followed by interrupting Margo''s sound cannon with ''You''re mine, pig!!'' — Rina Satou at her absolute best.', '2013-10-21T10:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 575, 'Miyuki_Advance_HQ', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Newbie', 118, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-22T02:28:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 576, 'EmikoFashionQueen', 'av-nekotoast', 'Member', 64, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-22T05:54:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 577, 'Andreas_VectorUplink', 'av-toonblock', 'Newbie', 20, true, 'Klaus saying ''I''m calling in Nova so that egg doesn''t destroy the damn continent''... NOVA IS BACK NEXT WEEK!! Remember her quote in Ep 1 about moral standing? Peak hype!', '2013-10-22T01:58:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 578, 'Klaus_DeadpanEnjoyer', 'av-day01', 'Newbie', 115, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-21T18:18:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 579, 'ChibiComet_92', 'av-chibicomet', 'Forum Regular', 1138, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-19T23:01:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 580, 'Zantenzetsuken_Cutter', 'av-shadowtoast', 'Member', 128, true, 'Abigail using Flame Gun recoil to kick herself sideways under Miyuki''s sonic shots was incredible comp work. The camera staying glued to her center of gravity while the background rotated into speed lines... peak sakuga.', '2013-10-21T02:24:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 581, 'HellsKitchenAnimu', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Forum Regular', 577, true, 'Abigail using Flame Gun recoil to kick herself sideways under Miyuki''s sonic shots was incredible comp work. The camera staying glued to her center of gravity while the background rotated into speed lines... peak sakuga.', '2013-10-21T12:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 582, 'Minko_PhysicsDefier', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 128, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-22T09:10:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 583, 'Andreas_VectorUplink', 'av-calsparrow', 'Newbie', 30, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-22T12:40:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 584, 'NodeCorePilot', 'av-mecharonin', 'Senior Member', 2257, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-22T21:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 585, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2501, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-19T19:16:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 586, 'Minko_PhysicsDefier', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 104, true, 'The whole sequence with the cart flying through the sky! Grayson white-knuckling the steering bar, Sora latching his red-white MetaCode threads onto the front axle to keep it level, Ben drilling through smoke, and Minko waving her scythe... Studio Burst created the most absurd yet epic war chariot in anime!', '2013-10-19T22:23:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 587, 'Nishikawa_OP_Hype', 'av-nodeomega', 'Newbie', 64, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-21T12:08:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 588, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-toonblock', 'Newbie', 93, true, 'Abigail using Flame Gun recoil to kick herself sideways under Miyuki''s sonic shots was incredible comp work. The camera staying glued to her center of gravity while the background rotated into speed lines... peak sakuga.', '2013-10-21T19:10:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 589, 'FinalBossu', 'av-finalbossu', 'Anime Addict', 4055, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-20T20:32:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 590, 'Nova_ContinentSaver', 'av-cyberlunchbox', 'Newbie', 119, true, 'Grayson walking Ignite down through bullets with Gojo spacing arrogance and Ichigo forward pressure was pure aura. He didn''t even run. Just steady, terrifying forward footsteps until Ignite had nowhere left to jump.', '2013-10-22T12:08:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 591, 'Eden_Day01', 'av-day01', 'Member', 339, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-23T08:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 592, 'CipherCaramel_Cyberpunk', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Member', 290, true, 'Grayson''s reaction to getting smacked by Minko''s scythe: ''Don''t do that again.'' Minko: ''Okay!''... the comedic timing between Okamoto and Minko''s VA is unmatched.', '2013-10-21T13:26:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 593, 'Eden_Day01', 'av-day01', 'Member', 352, true, 'Kana Hanazawa and Saori Hayami giving the performances of their careers. When Abigail caught Zantenzetsuken between both Flame Gun frames, slid inside Miyuki''s guard, and delivered that heavy spin-kick that made Miyuki''s forearm visibly shake from adrenaline and pain?! That''s the first time Miyuki''s perfect ice-queen composure broke!', '2013-10-20T03:23:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 594, 'PlanetationBro', 'av-bluesoda', 'Senior Member', 1959, true, 'Kana Hanazawa and Saori Hayami giving the performances of their careers. When Abigail caught Zantenzetsuken between both Flame Gun frames, slid inside Miyuki''s guard, and delivered that heavy spin-kick that made Miyuki''s forearm visibly shake from adrenaline and pain?! That''s the first time Miyuki''s perfect ice-queen composure broke!', '2013-10-23T07:06:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 595, 'StormWallTheory', 'av-stormwalltheory', 'Senior Member', 3107, true, 'Kaito Ishikawa''s vocal delivery on ''HERE''S YOUR L!'' gave me actual goosebumps. And then slamming Maxino through two fossil ribs down into the ridge! When Ben faceplanted in the dirt murmuring ''Scientific reaction...'' and then hit his engine with a wrench: ''You''ve got five more minutes in you. That wasn''t a question.'' What a legendary bro!', '2013-10-19T22:43:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 596, 'Cart_Formula1_Pilot', 'av-bostonbean', 'Newbie', 106, true, 'The whole sequence with the cart flying through the sky! Grayson white-knuckling the steering bar, Sora latching his red-white MetaCode threads onto the front axle to keep it level, Ben drilling through smoke, and Minko waving her scythe... Studio Burst created the most absurd yet epic war chariot in anime!', '2013-10-22T21:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 597, 'ArthurWhiteCommander', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 43, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-20T02:55:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 598, 'SakugaThreadZero', 'av-zeroframe', 'Database Contributor', 5953, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-19T19:02:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 599, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2207, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-20T11:41:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 600, 'likko-chwangun213', 'av-sakurastatic', 'Forum Regular', 768, true, 'Abigail vs Miyuki was so raw and personal. Zero graceful tournament rules — just six years of hatred exploding on screen.', '2013-10-23T07:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 601, 'FinalBossu', 'av-finalbossu', 'Anime Addict', 4048, true, 'The contrast between Grayson''s grounded boxing stance and IgniteCOD rage-typing in chat: ''??? Who the f---? Get off me!'' and ''Look at this, bitch!'' while dropping launch pads and quickscoping like an angry 14-year-old on Modern Warfare 2 is the greatest gaming comedy in anime history.', '2013-10-21T00:49:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 602, 'LisaSniperQueen', 'av-kappazero', 'Newbie', 87, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-23T02:38:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 603, 'Zantenzetsuken_Cutter', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Newbie', 31, true, 'THAT CLIFFHANGER IS EVIL. Margo drops the blue device, Andreas screams ''Grayson, don''t land there!'', and the whole battlefield literally folds like paper into a black hole?!', '2013-10-21T09:23:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 604, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-kappazero', 'Newbie', 23, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-20T09:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
