  ('ioe-ep3', 612, 'AbigailFanAlready', 'av-abigailfan', 'Member', 554, true, 'Minko Abercrombie losing arguments with physics was the comedic highlight of the year. Tripping on her own shoes, sliding down a hill on her stomach, screaming ''I meant to do that!... I didn''t mean to do that!'' while accidentally deflecting Likko''s shotgun shells with her scythe!', '2013-10-22T19:08:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 613, 'HellsKitchenAnimu', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Forum Regular', 581, true, 'Sora leaping out of the cart, spinning into a high-speed MetaCode Beyblade into Kieran and William, but explicitly avoiding Echo and Miyuki because ''I respect women''??? Bro is 12 years old and already a gentleman XD', '2013-10-22T02:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 614, 'ShounenLifer_VHS', 'av-vhssamurai', 'Anime Addict', 4242, true, 'Grayson''s reaction to getting smacked by Minko''s scythe: ''Don''t do that again.'' Minko: ''Okay!''... the comedic timing between Okamoto and Minko''s VA is unmatched.', '2013-10-20T01:12:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
