  ('ioe-ep3', 660, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-calsparrow', 'Newbie', 137, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-22T03:17:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
