  ('ioe-ep3', 662, 'RetroBluRay_AMV', 'av-retrobluray', 'Forum Regular', 1479, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-21T12:29:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 663, 'BenSmytheGaming', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Newbie', 102, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-22T01:54:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 664, 'Nova_ContinentSaver', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 45, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-22T09:07:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 665, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2208, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-21T01:32:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 666, 'BenSmytheGaming', 'av-day01', 'Newbie', 137, true, 'Likko running down the wall like an elegant classical ballerina with her rhythm shotgun to fast piano music (''4e corde! Tempo miracle ultra-rapide!'')... only for Minko to get caught in the route wheel, spin 360 degrees, get catapulted across the canyon into a tree, chase the cart on foot, and whack Grayson in the back of the head with her scythe handle: ''OW! DAMMIT, MINKO!''', '2013-10-20T04:01:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 667, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Member', 33, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-20T09:41:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 668, 'Minko_PhysicsDefier', 'av-3eprule', 'Member', 96, true, 'The choreography on Grayson''s spinning back kick anticipating Ignite''s purple vow teleport exit... you can see the anticipation frames where Grayson rotates his hips before Ignite even materializes. That is high-level action direction.', '2013-10-21T02:13:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
