  ('ioe-ep3', 798, 'AbigailFanAlready', 'av-abigailfan', 'Member', 553, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-21T13:22:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 799, 'FinalBossu', 'av-finalbossu', 'Anime Addict', 4047, true, 'Sora leaping out of the cart, spinning into a high-speed MetaCode Beyblade into Kieran and William, but explicitly avoiding Echo and Miyuki because ''I respect women''??? Bro is 12 years old and already a gentleman XD', '2013-10-21T22:18:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 800, 'Andreas_VectorUplink', 'av-toonblock', 'Newbie', 64, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-22T14:01:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 801, 'Cart_Formula1_Pilot', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 133, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-22T02:02:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 802, 'LisaSniperQueen', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 114, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-23T09:39:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
