  ('ioe-ep3', 805, 'ImageboardGoblin', 'av-forumgoblin', 'Member', 460, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-20T19:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 806, 'BenSmytheGaming', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Newbie', 33, true, 'Minko Abercrombie losing arguments with physics was the comedic highlight of the year. Tripping on her own shoes, sliding down a hill on her stomach, screaming ''I meant to do that!... I didn''t mean to do that!'' while accidentally deflecting Likko''s shotgun shells with her scythe!', '2013-10-20T22:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 807, 'EchoDesmond_Loyalist', 'av-robomango', 'Member', 24, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-22T10:38:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 808, 'GraysonRothenbergStan', 'av-toonblock', 'Newbie', 130, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-21T18:40:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 809, 'NovaFanPixel', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Database Contributor', 6273, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-19T23:13:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 810, 'PressureChain_God', 'av-cyberlunchbox', 'Newbie', 76, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-23T04:34:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 811, 'Zantenzetsuken_Cutter', 'av-vermilionowl', 'Newbie', 127, true, 'Abigail vs Miyuki was so raw and personal. Zero graceful tournament rules — just six years of hatred exploding on screen.', '2013-10-22T07:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 812, 'xXSoraGauthier_KunXx', 'av-starcircuit', 'Anime Addict', 1404, true, 'Sora leaping out of the cart, spinning into a high-speed MetaCode Beyblade into Kieran and William, but explicitly avoiding Echo and Miyuki because ''I respect women''??? Bro is 12 years old and already a gentleman XD', '2013-10-22T02:44:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 813, 'NodeCorePilot', 'av-mecharonin', 'Senior Member', 2247, true, 'Lisa Hoshino vs Echo Desmond was the most stylish, petty catfight of the decade. Lisa''s internal monologue: ''Don''t shoot the person. Shoot the step they need.'' followed by interrupting Margo''s sound cannon with ''You''re mine, pig!!'' — Rina Satou at her absolute best.', '2013-10-23T04:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 814, 'NodeCoreOmega', 'av-nodeomega', 'Senior Member', 2933, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-19T20:39:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 815, 'Nova_ContinentSaver', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Newbie', 54, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-23T07:23:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 816, 'sleepySenpai_DesuKa', 'av-sleepysenpai', 'Member', 425, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-21T00:22:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 817, 'PlanetationKid', 'av-planetkid', 'Newbie', 83, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-20T23:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 818, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Member', 38, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-21T01:11:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 819, 'StormWallTheory', 'av-stormwalltheory', 'Senior Member', 3092, true, 'THAT CLIFFHANGER IS EVIL. Margo drops the blue device, Andreas screams ''Grayson, don''t land there!'', and the whole battlefield literally folds like paper into a black hole?!', '2013-10-22T09:29:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 820, 'Cart_Formula1_Pilot', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Newbie', 106, true, 'THAT CLIFFHANGER IS EVIL. Margo drops the blue device, Andreas screams ''Grayson, don''t land there!'', and the whole battlefield literally folds like paper into a black hole?!', '2013-10-23T04:11:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 821, 'ToonblockKid', 'av-toonblock', 'Forum Regular', 681, true, 'The choreography on Grayson''s spinning back kick anticipating Ignite''s purple vow teleport exit... you can see the anticipation frames where Grayson rotates his hips before Ignite even materializes. That is high-level action direction.', '2013-10-23T06:37:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 822, 'EmikoFashionQueen', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 102, true, 'Sora shattering the route line under Nero''s boots, doing the cat-ears grin with the forehead ''L'' sign, whispering ''Later~'', and blitz-dashing away... pure scrappy protagonist brilliance :3', '2013-10-21T09:45:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 823, 'Klaus_DeadpanEnjoyer', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Newbie', 121, true, 'The whole sequence with the cart flying through the sky! Grayson white-knuckling the steering bar, Sora latching his red-white MetaCode threads onto the front axle to keep it level, Ben drilling through smoke, and Minko waving her scythe... Studio Burst created the most absurd yet epic war chariot in anime!', '2013-10-20T23:15:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 824, 'ShounenLifer_VHS', 'av-vhssamurai', 'Anime Addict', 4256, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-22T03:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 825, 'likko-chwangun213', 'av-sakurastatic', 'Forum Regular', 776, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-20T19:29:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 826, 'VoidRift_Survivor', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 104, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-22T13:58:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 827, 'TokuFanMango', 'av-robomango', 'Forum Regular', 951, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-20T08:37:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 828, 'GraysonSus_NotSus', 'av-kiranotkira', 'Forum Regular', 667, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-22T22:06:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 829, 'SakugaThreadZero', 'av-zeroframe', 'Database Contributor', 5972, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-23T07:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 830, 'ScientificReactionsBro', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Member', 64, true, 'The choreography on Grayson''s spinning back kick anticipating Ignite''s purple vow teleport exit... you can see the anticipation frames where Grayson rotates his hips before Ignite even materializes. That is high-level action direction.', '2013-10-22T21:35:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
