  ('ioe-ep3', 832, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2205, true, 'THAT CLIFFHANGER IS EVIL. Margo drops the blue device, Andreas screams ''Grayson, don''t land there!'', and the whole battlefield literally folds like paper into a black hole?!', '2013-10-22T01:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 833, 'CipherCaramel_Cyberpunk', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Member', 302, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-23T09:09:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 834, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-hyperneko', 'Newbie', 116, true, 'Abigail using Flame Gun recoil to kick herself sideways under Miyuki''s sonic shots was incredible comp work. The camera staying glued to her center of gravity while the background rotated into speed lines... peak sakuga.', '2013-10-21T02:16:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 835, 'sleepySenpai_DesuKa', 'av-sleepysenpai', 'Member', 424, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-22T04:46:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 836, 'ToonblockKid', 'av-toonblock', 'Forum Regular', 682, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-21T11:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 837, 'HellsKitchenAnimu', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Forum Regular', 577, true, 'Likko running down the wall like an elegant classical ballerina with her rhythm shotgun to fast piano music (''4e corde! Tempo miracle ultra-rapide!'')... only for Minko to get caught in the route wheel, spin 360 degrees, get catapulted across the canyon into a tree, chase the cart on foot, and whack Grayson in the back of the head with her scythe handle: ''OW! DAMMIT, MINKO!''', '2013-10-21T13:56:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 838, 'HollowToast', 'av-hollowtoast', 'Senior Member', 2506, true, 'The whole sequence with the cart flying through the sky! Grayson white-knuckling the steering bar, Sora latching his red-white MetaCode threads onto the front axle to keep it level, Ben drilling through smoke, and Minko waving her scythe... Studio Burst created the most absurd yet epic war chariot in anime!', '2013-10-22T00:24:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 839, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Newbie', 23, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-21T00:43:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 840, 'FinalBossu', 'av-finalbossu', 'Anime Addict', 4053, true, 'Kaito Ishikawa''s vocal delivery on ''HERE''S YOUR L!'' gave me actual goosebumps. And then slamming Maxino through two fossil ribs down into the ridge! When Ben faceplanted in the dirt murmuring ''Scientific reaction...'' and then hit his engine with a wrench: ''You''ve got five more minutes in you. That wasn''t a question.'' What a legendary bro!', '2013-10-21T12:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 841, 'NovaFanPixel', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Database Contributor', 6278, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-20T02:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 842, 'likko-chwangun213', 'av-sakurastatic', 'Forum Regular', 785, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-23T03:46:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 843, 'HirotoHiro53', 'av-sorawatcher', 'Newbie', 60, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-21T12:18:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 844, 'ED_Appreciator', 'av-3eprule', 'Member', 25, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-21T13:20:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 845, 'Eden_Day01', 'av-day01', 'Member', 338, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-20T13:36:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 846, '3EpisodeRule', 'av-3eprule', 'Senior Member', 1568, true, 'Likko running down the wall like an elegant classical ballerina with her rhythm shotgun to fast piano music (''4e corde! Tempo miracle ultra-rapide!'')... only for Minko to get caught in the route wheel, spin 360 degrees, get catapulted across the canyon into a tree, chase the cart on foot, and whack Grayson in the back of the head with her scythe handle: ''OW! DAMMIT, MINKO!''', '2013-10-23T01:37:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 847, 'GraysonRothenbergStan', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Newbie', 32, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-20T19:22:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 848, 'PressureChain_God', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 48, true, 'Echo Desmond with that ridiculous Anchor Armament — switching from dual blades to twin rotary machine guns and then locking them into that massive double-edged Anchor Greatsword! And pausing mid-fight just to insult Lisa''s shoes: ''I''m staring at how UGLY your shoes look'' — ''Nobody cares! Garbage!!'' Then ending in a mutual double drop-kick where both girls get sent flying!', '2013-10-20T01:44:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 849, 'HellsKitchenAnimu', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Forum Regular', 584, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-22T10:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 850, 'Nishikawa_OP_Hype', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 68, true, 'Sora leaping out of the cart, spinning into a high-speed MetaCode Beyblade into Kieran and William, but explicitly avoiding Echo and Miyuki because ''I respect women''??? Bro is 12 years old and already a gentleman XD', '2013-10-21T08:57:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 851, 'ShadowToast', 'av-shadowtoast', 'Member', 166, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-22T05:48:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 852, 'PlanetationBro', 'av-bluesoda', 'Senior Member', 1954, true, 'The dialogue between Abigail and Miyuki was savage: ''Miyuki, it''s been 6 years and you''re still hurting everyone!'' / ''And that''s the problem! You''re acting as if there are rights to rebel against authority!'' / ''Do not tell me what to do, you lower caste pig!''', '2013-10-22T03:07:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 853, 'FinalBossu', 'av-finalbossu', 'Anime Addict', 4048, true, 'The contrast between Grayson''s grounded boxing stance and IgniteCOD rage-typing in chat: ''??? Who the f---? Get off me!'' and ''Look at this, bitch!'' while dropping launch pads and quickscoping like an angry 14-year-old on Modern Warfare 2 is the greatest gaming comedy in anime history.', '2013-10-20T13:47:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 854, 'NeroRouteMaster', 'av-drowsyvhs', 'Newbie', 35, true, 'Minko Abercrombie losing arguments with physics was the comedic highlight of the year. Tripping on her own shoes, sliding down a hill on her stomach, screaming ''I meant to do that!... I didn''t mean to do that!'' while accidentally deflecting Likko''s shotgun shells with her scythe!', '2013-10-20T04:14:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 855, 'NekoToast92', 'av-nekotoast', 'Forum Regular', 933, true, 'The dialogue between Abigail and Miyuki was savage: ''Miyuki, it''s been 6 years and you''re still hurting everyone!'' / ''And that''s the problem! You''re acting as if there are rights to rebel against authority!'' / ''Do not tell me what to do, you lower caste pig!''', '2013-10-22T23:38:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 856, 'Eden_Day01', 'av-day01', 'Member', 343, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-22T13:30:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 857, 'Andreas_VectorUplink', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Newbie', 48, true, 'Klaus saying ''I''m calling in Nova so that egg doesn''t destroy the damn continent''... NOVA IS BACK NEXT WEEK!! Remember her quote in Ep 1 about moral standing? Peak hype!', '2013-10-22T11:04:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 858, 'NodeCorePilot', 'av-mecharonin', 'Senior Member', 2257, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-22T08:27:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 859, 'NovaFanPixel', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Database Contributor', 6274, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-21T02:11:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
