  ('ioe-ep3', 868, 'ED_Appreciator', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 138, true, 'The dialogue between Abigail and Miyuki was savage: ''Miyuki, it''s been 6 years and you''re still hurting everyone!'' / ''And that''s the problem! You''re acting as if there are rights to rebel against authority!'' / ''Do not tell me what to do, you lower caste pig!''', '2013-10-22T08:07:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 869, 'RetroBluRay_AMV', 'av-retrobluray', 'Forum Regular', 1484, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-19T19:08:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 870, 'EmikoFashionQueen', 'av-kitchenstar', 'Newbie', 34, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-22T12:39:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 871, 'ED_Appreciator', 'av-nodeomega', 'Newbie', 66, true, 'The dialogue between Abigail and Miyuki was savage: ''Miyuki, it''s been 6 years and you''re still hurting everyone!'' / ''And that''s the problem! You''re acting as if there are rights to rebel against authority!'' / ''Do not tell me what to do, you lower caste pig!''', '2013-10-20T06:13:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 872, 'NovaFanPixel', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Database Contributor', 6272, true, 'The choreography on Grayson''s spinning back kick anticipating Ignite''s purple vow teleport exit... you can see the anticipation frames where Grayson rotates his hips before Ignite even materializes. That is high-level action direction.', '2013-10-23T02:41:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 873, 'BurstAnimKid', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Member', 304, true, 'Lisa Hoshino vs Echo Desmond was the most stylish, petty catfight of the decade. Lisa''s internal monologue: ''Don''t shoot the person. Shoot the step they need.'' followed by interrupting Margo''s sound cannon with ''You''re mine, pig!!'' — Rina Satou at her absolute best.', '2013-10-23T11:36:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 874, 'MaxinoDemolitionFan', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Newbie', 38, true, 'Abigail using Flame Gun recoil to kick herself sideways under Miyuki''s sonic shots was incredible comp work. The camera staying glued to her center of gravity while the background rotated into speed lines... peak sakuga.', '2013-10-20T10:43:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 875, 'GraysonRothenbergStan', 'av-hyperneko', 'Member', 93, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-21T01:10:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 876, 'Minko_PhysicsDefier', 'av-robomango', 'Newbie', 60, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-23T10:28:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 877, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 54, true, 'Lisa Hoshino vs Echo Desmond was the most stylish, petty catfight of the decade. Lisa''s internal monologue: ''Don''t shoot the person. Shoot the step they need.'' followed by interrupting Margo''s sound cannon with ''You''re mine, pig!!'' — Rina Satou at her absolute best.', '2013-10-21T04:23:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 878, 'TokuFanMango', 'av-robomango', 'Forum Regular', 951, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-20T03:11:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 879, 'Miyuki_Advance_HQ', 'av-toonblock', 'Newbie', 43, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-21T00:03:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 880, 'VoidRift_Survivor', 'av-okamoto', 'Newbie', 106, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-21T19:02:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 881, 'ShounenLifer_VHS', 'av-vhssamurai', 'Anime Addict', 4256, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-22T09:38:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 882, 'NekoToast92', 'av-nekotoast', 'Forum Regular', 927, true, 'The dialogue between Abigail and Miyuki was savage: ''Miyuki, it''s been 6 years and you''re still hurting everyone!'' / ''And that''s the problem! You''re acting as if there are rights to rebel against authority!'' / ''Do not tell me what to do, you lower caste pig!''', '2013-10-22T02:28:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 883, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-robomango', 'Member', 60, true, 'The kinetic animation when Ben throws Sora toward Nero: Sora falls into the ground hard, but rolls through the dirt to absorb the shock, immediately pushes back up, and charges straight into Nero! It''s not comedic relief — you feel the raw momentum, grit, and tenacity of him refusing to stay down.', '2013-10-20T07:02:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 884, 'ScientificReactionsBro', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 119, true, 'Kaito Ishikawa''s vocal delivery on ''HERE''S YOUR L!'' gave me actual goosebumps. And then slamming Maxino through two fossil ribs down into the ridge! When Ben faceplanted in the dirt murmuring ''Scientific reaction...'' and then hit his engine with a wrench: ''You''ve got five more minutes in you. That wasn''t a question.'' What a legendary bro!', '2013-10-21T21:15:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 885, 'Eden_Day01', 'av-day01', 'Member', 349, true, 'THAT CLIFFHANGER IS EVIL. Margo drops the blue device, Andreas screams ''Grayson, don''t land there!'', and the whole battlefield literally folds like paper into a black hole?!', '2013-10-19T22:30:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 886, 'KaichouEnjoyer', 'av-kaichouenjoyer', 'Anime Addict', 2199, true, 'The whole sequence with the cart flying through the sky! Grayson white-knuckling the steering bar, Sora latching his red-white MetaCode threads onto the front axle to keep it level, Ben drilling through smoke, and Minko waving her scythe... Studio Burst created the most absurd yet epic war chariot in anime!', '2013-10-21T11:28:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 887, 'AbigailFlameRush', 'av-robomango', 'Member', 94, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-20T19:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 888, 'PressureChain_God', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Newbie', 25, true, 'Echo Desmond with that ridiculous Anchor Armament — switching from dual blades to twin rotary machine guns and then locking them into that massive double-edged Anchor Greatsword! And pausing mid-fight just to insult Lisa''s shoes: ''I''m staring at how UGLY your shoes look'' — ''Nobody cares! Garbage!!'' Then ending in a mutual double drop-kick where both girls get sent flying!', '2013-10-20T18:58:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 889, 'NekoToast92', 'av-nekotoast', 'Forum Regular', 931, true, 'Abigail vs Miyuki was so raw and personal. Zero graceful tournament rules — just six years of hatred exploding on screen.', '2013-10-22T10:30:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 890, 'Miyuki_Advance_HQ', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Member', 103, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-22T05:52:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 891, 'CipherCaramel_Cyberpunk', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Member', 297, true, 'The sound design on Echo''s Anchor Greatsword connecting with the fossil arch was deafening. You can feel the sheer kinetic weight in Burst''s sound mixing.', '2013-10-22T22:05:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 892, 'ArthurWhiteCommander', 'av-kappazero', 'Newbie', 74, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-19T22:54:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 893, '3EpisodeRule', 'av-3eprule', 'Senior Member', 1570, true, 'Sora leaping out of the cart, spinning into a high-speed MetaCode Beyblade into Kieran and William, but explicitly avoiding Echo and Miyuki because ''I respect women''??? Bro is 12 years old and already a gentleman XD', '2013-10-21T19:24:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 894, 'BurstAnimKid', 'av-luckynoodle', 'Member', 301, true, 'Klaus saying ''I''m calling in Nova so that egg doesn''t destroy the damn continent''... NOVA IS BACK NEXT WEEK!! Remember her quote in Ep 1 about moral standing? Peak hype!', '2013-10-23T12:51:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 895, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-ciphercaramel', 'Member', 108, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-22T23:47:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 896, 'PlanetationBro', 'av-bluesoda', 'Senior Member', 1958, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-22T12:16:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 897, 'ArthurWhiteCommander', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Newbie', 28, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-21T11:26:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 898, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-millenniumfan', 'Member', 53, true, 'Ben Smythe is the absolute MVP of this episode. Maxino triggering that 45-second Grand Finale countdown with the entire floor lighting up in red and gold firework fuse lines was insane.', '2013-10-20T23:47:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 899, 'RawrXD_2007', 'av-rawrxd', 'Member', 241, true, 'Sora vs Nero was a psychological battle disguised as an action sequence. Nero''s 3-lane route grid (blue = move, yellow = delay, red = punish) wasn''t just a boss gimmick; Nero was literally reading player psychology. He counted on Sora''s shounen instinct to rush in whenever someone yelled.', '2013-10-20T13:01:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 900, 'Klaus_DeadpanEnjoyer', 'av-zeroframe', 'Newbie', 113, true, 'Preview quote: ''There will be an investigation of the source to ensure the safety of the other game world''s... Country!'' Next episode: SOUL ANCHOR!', '2013-10-21T06:41:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
