  ('ioe-ep3', 908, 'ED_Appreciator', 'av-nekotoast', 'Newbie', 34, true, 'Klaus saying ''I''m calling in Nova so that egg doesn''t destroy the damn continent''... NOVA IS BACK NEXT WEEK!! Remember her quote in Ep 1 about moral standing? Peak hype!', '2013-10-22T06:42:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 909, 'GraysonSus_NotSus', 'av-kiranotkira', 'Forum Regular', 660, true, 'Miyuki Sawashiro''s ED ''24 Hours Everyday'' showing Abigail''s peaceful school routine vs her bleeding in the game... tears in my eyes. Such a beautiful, nostalgic song ;_;', '2013-10-20T10:15:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 910, 'AbigailFlameRush', 'av-robomango', 'Newbie', 114, true, 'Ben didn''t even try to dodge at the end. At 96% heat, he literally ran straight through overlapping blast zones, ate the explosion point-blank with sparks and blood flying everywhere, and rammed that spinning NodeCore drill right through Maxino''s guard roaring ''HERE''S YOUR L!''', '2013-10-20T21:04:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 911, 'Klaus_DeadpanEnjoyer', 'av-nekotoast', 'Newbie', 97, true, 'Sora and Abigail reaching out for each other, their fingertips missing by two centimeters, and then the screen flashes white and EVERYONE GETS SUCKED IN?? Every single UI card reading SIGNAL LOST at once!', '2013-10-19T20:34:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 912, 'ArthurWhiteCommander', 'av-3eprule', 'Member', 106, true, 'Kana Hanazawa and Saori Hayami giving the performances of their careers. When Abigail caught Zantenzetsuken between both Flame Gun frames, slid inside Miyuki''s guard, and delivered that heavy spin-kick that made Miyuki''s forearm visibly shake from adrenaline and pain?! That''s the first time Miyuki''s perfect ice-queen composure broke!', '2013-10-23T12:50:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 913, 'NeroRouteMaster', 'av-rawrxd', 'Newbie', 56, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-20T14:27:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 914, 'Zantenzetsuken_Cutter', 'av-day01', 'Member', 79, true, 'Maxino was such a cool boss design. The firework cylinders strapped to his rig, throwing smoke canisters and using gold blast zones to launch Ben into traps... but Ben turning the launch blast into aerial momentum with Flight Mode was galaxy-brain play.', '2013-10-21T09:02:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 915, 'Grayson_Ignition_DualBlades', 'av-bostonbean', 'Newbie', 37, true, 'Kagura holding back the Crucible flames until the very end — hands and kicks win the space, Crucibles cash out the damage! That Red Divide cut splitting the corridor in two with that delayed three-frame impact hold... Kagura is an animation god.', '2013-10-20T11:02:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 916, 'EmikoFashionQueen', 'av-robomango', 'Newbie', 55, true, 'Look at the weight in Sora''s landing when Ben launches him in — he hits the ground, tucks into a combat roll, pushes right back up to his feet without losing speed, and charges Nero head-on. Sora''s scrappy physical combat style is so satisfying to watch!', '2013-10-22T13:21:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
