  ('ioe-ep3', 921, 'Zantenzetsuken_Cutter', 'av-goldensloth', 'Member', 125, true, 'Emiko calling Arthur White ''Whitie~ You there~?'' in the post-credits scene! She''s the acting CEO of FRM while casually walking a fashion show in Shell 2?! The lore rabbit hole goes so deep.', '2013-10-22T11:40:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
  ('ioe-ep3', 922, 'SoraGauthier_Fanboy', 'av-goldensloth', 'Newbie', 55, true, 'Action Director Kagura completely reinvented anime swordplay in Grayson vs IgniteCOD_Clutch. Look at the keyframes: when Ignite tries to slide, Grayson doesn''t swing a sword — he drops his hips and stamps a stiff low kick into the knee! Then a lead jab to check the SMG reload, and that brutal axe kick crashing down straight through the build panel! It''s actual boxing and Muay Thai mechanics instead of floaty anime sword-flailing!', '2013-10-23T11:53:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
