  ('ioe-ep3', 927, 'NovaFanPixel', 'av-moonlitpixel', 'Database Contributor', 6265, true, 'The animation when Sora realizes flash-stepping is a trap and takes that ordinary, slow, human step? ''Nero''s prediction was perfect. That was why it failed. It predicted the Sora who had already panicked.'' Burst''s storyboarders understand pacing on a fundamental level.', '2013-10-22T21:29:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'archived'),
